2 CONT *'''     Sir George Browne was born in 1439 at Beechworth, Surrey, England.2 He was the son''' of Sir Thomas Browne and Eleanor Fitzalan.1
2 CONT *'''     He lived at Bettsworth Castle, Surrey, England.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Sir George Browne
2 CONT **Sir Matthew Browne+1
