2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p24453.htm#i244521 '''Death date and place variously reported. May or may not have been the http://www.geni.com/people/William-Browne/6000000037060798947  whose son John settled permanently in Tavi
2 CONC stock, Devonshire and begat the line that led to the Jacobean pastoral poet William Browne (c. 1590-c. 1645).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT *_______________________
2 CONT *'''William BROWNE
2 CONT *'''Born: 1441
