2 CONT *'''Sir Anthony Browne1
2 CONT *'''M, #1026, b. 29 June 1443, d. 19 November 1506
2 CONT *Last Edited=3 Apr 2009
2 CONT *'''     Sir Anthony Browne was born on 29 June 1443 at Bettsworth Castle, Surrey, England.2 He was the son of Sir Thomas Browne and Eleanor Fitzalan.1 He married Lady Lucy Neville, daughter of Sir John Neville, 1st and last Marqu
2 CONC ess of Montagu and Isabel Ingaldesthorpe, before 1506.3 He died on 19 November 1506 at age 63 at Calais, Normandy, France.2
2 CONT *'''     He held the office of Standard-Bearer of England.3
2 CONT *'''Child of Sir Anthony Browne and Alice (?)
2 CONT ** 1.Anne Browne d. c 1511
2 CONT *'''Children of Sir Anthony Browne and Lady Lucy Neville
2 CONT ** 1.Elizabeth Browne+4 d. bt 20 Apr 1565 - 23 Oct 1565
2 CONT ** 2.Anne Browne+5
2 CONT ** 3.Lucy Browne6
2 CONT ** 4.Sir Anthony Browne+ b. 1500, d. 1548
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S15] George Edward Cokayne, editor, The Complete Baronetage, 5 volumes (no date (c. 1900); reprint, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 1983), volume II, page 28. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Baronetage.
2 CONT * 2.[S2313] Rob Underhill, "re: Stanley Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 9 June 2007. Hereinafter cited as "re: Stanley Family."
2 CONT * 3.[S8] BP1999 volume 1, page 17. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S8]
2 CONT * 4.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume XII/2, page 852. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT * 5.[S37] BP2003 volume 1, page 1103. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT * 6.[S37] BP2003. [S37]
