2 CONT *Death: 	1565, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT *Dowager Countess of Worcester
2 CONT *Dowager Lady Herbert
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Daughter of===
2 CONT  *Sir Anthony Browne and Lady Lucy Neville. Paternal granddaughter of Sir Thomas Browne, Sheriff of Kent, and Eleanor FitzAlan. Maternal granddaughter of John Neville, 1st Marquess of Montagu, and Isabel Ingoldesthorpe.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children:===
2 CONT
2 CONT *  Mary Somerset*
2 CONT *  Lucy Somerset Neville (1524 - 1583)*
2 CONT *  William Somerset (1526 - 1589)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Elizabeth was the second wife of '''Henry Somerset''', 2nd Earl of Worcester, and the mother of his children. Her eldest son succeeded to his father's titles, while her eldest daughter became the Countess of Northumberland.
2 CONT
2 CONT After Henry's death, she never remarried and was buried with him when she died n 1565
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Countess of Worcester;  Served as lady-in-waiting to Anne Bolyne and was main informant against her.  Some speculation exists that she may have been a mistress of King Henry VIII.
2 CONT
2 CONT
