2 CONT 17. NICHOLAS4 BROWNE (Edward3, William2, John1), son of (13) Edward3 and (WK-2) Jane (LIDE) BROWNE, was born in 1601 in Inkberrow Parish[4], and died on 5 April 1673 in Reading[3, 16]. He married (1st) in England, ELIZABETH, who d
