2 CONT 87. RUTH7 BROWNE (Eleazer6, Thomas5, Nicholas4, Edward3, William2, John1), daughter of (45) Eleazer6 and (ADG-16) Ann (PENDLETON) BROWNE, was born on 30 June 1714 in Stonington[15], and died on 20 May 1791 in Colchester[7]. She ma
2 CONC rried in Stonington, in 1733, (AES-5) BENJAMIN RANDALL[7], son of (AES-4) John Jr. and (CT-13) Mary (BALDWIN), who was born on 2 June 1715 in Stonington[5, 8], was christened on 14 Aug. 1715, and died on 15 June 1811 in Colchester
2 CONC [8]. [6, 7, 15, 19]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: See (AES-5) Benjamin RANDALL
