2 CONT *''''''   Anthony Browne, 1st Viscount Montagu was born circa 1527. He was the son of Sir Anthony Browne and Alice Gage. He married, firstly, Lady Jane Radcliffe, daughter of Robert Radcliffe, 1st Earl of Sussex and Lady Margaret 
2 CONC Stanley, circa 1551.3 He married, secondly, Magdalen Dacre, daughter of William Dacre, 3rd Lord Dacre (of Gilsland) and Lady Elizabeth Talbot, before 10 December 1558.4,5 He died in 1592.
2 CONT *''''''     He gained the title of 1st Viscount Montagu. He has an extensive biographical entry in the Dictionary of National Biography.6
