2 CONT     Death: 19 OCT 1592 in West Horsley, Surrey
2 CONT     Burial: 6 DEC 1592 Midhurst
2 CONT     Religion: Sources: Roberts, Gary Boyd. "Ancestors of American Presidene boundaries of Rose Hill..
2 CONT     Note:
2 CONT     Note: One of the 40 knights at the coronation of Edward VI, 20 Feb1546/7. Succeeded his father 6 May 1548 and had license to enteron his inheritance 4 May 1550. He was one of the 15 executors ofQueen Mary, and one of the chief
2 CONC  mourners at her funeral. Hewas one of the two peers who opposed the separation of Englandfrom the Rom. Cath. Church and the Act for the Queen's supremacyin the first year of Elizabeth, 1559; on a mission to Madrid,Jan. to June 15
2 CONC 60; and to Flanders in Mar. 1564/5, and again in1566. In 1571/2 he was implicated in the plot for marrying theDuke of lNorfolk to Mary, Queen of Scots, which cost the Dukehis life. J.P. for cos. Suirrey and Sussex, 1578. He was on
2 CONC eof ther 24 noblemen who were commissioners or the trial of Mary,Queen of Scots, at Fotheringhay in Oct., 1586. He entertainedthe Queen (Elizabeth) sumptuously at Cowdray (his home) for sixdays in Aug. 1591.
