2 CONT *7.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 275-276.
2 CONT *8.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 534.
2 CONT *9.[S61] Unknown author, Family Group Sheets, SLC Archives.
2 CONT *10.[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. IV, p. 160-161.
