2 CONT
2 CONT Mildred Sackville was born circa 1490 at of Buckhurst, Sussex, England. She married Sir William FitzWilliam, Alderman & Sheriff of London, son of John II FitzWilliam, Esq. and Ellen Villiers, circa 1514; They had 3 sons (Christoph
2 CONC er; Francis; & Thomas, Esq.) and 2 daughters (Eleanor, wife of Sir Nicholas Strange; & Mary, wife of John Shelley, Esq.)1,4,2,3 Mildred Sackville died before 1529.2,3
2 CONT
