2 CONT Anthony BROWNE (Sir) Born: 22 Jul 1552, Cowdray, Cowdray, Sussex, England Died: 29 Jun 1592, Riverbank House, Cowdray Park or in?Thorpe, Bucks, England Buried: 1 Aug 1592, Midhurst Church, Cowdray, Sussex, England
