1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Christopher Maunsell is the son of Sir Edward Mansel and Lady Jane Somerset.2 He married Anne Worsley, daughter of Sir Robert Worsley.1      
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived at Percywood, Gower, Glamorgan, Wales.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Christopher Maunsell and Anne Worsley
2 CONT # Jane Maunsell2
2 CONT # Hope Maunsell2
2 CONT # Dorothy Maunsell2
