1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The dob as 1509 is incorrect for this particular Robert.'''  There are multiple Robert Oxenbridges and it seems some have gotten mixed up  Also, I've seen nothing to validate the use of John as the middle name. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Robert Oxenbridge==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: Barbara White, daughter of Thomas White, Knight Master of the Requests 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert and Barbara had a number of children who lived to adulthood including that Elizabeth Oxenbridge who married Edward Woodward of Upton, co Buck; esq; privy chamber to James 1 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Robert Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Goddard Oxenbridge
2 CONT * William Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Elizabeth Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Susan Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Ann Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Henry Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Gaberiel Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Richard Oxenbridge
2 CONT * John Oxenbridge
2 CONT
