1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sir Thomas Kempe1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8
2 CONT *'''M, #21983, b. 7 November 1551, d. before 10 December 1607
2 CONT *Father     Sir Thomas Kempe, Sheriff of Kent2,9 b. c 1513, d. 7 Mar 1591
2 CONT *Mother     Amy Moyle2,9 b. c 1529
2 CONT *'''     Sir Thomas Kempe was christened on 7 November 1551 at Wye, Kent, England.2,4,7 He married Anne circa 1582 at of Kent, England; Three children born to this marriage, including 1 son, Isaac.2,4 Sir Thomas Kempe married Doro
2 CONC thy Thompson, daughter of John Thompson, Esq., Sheriff of Bedfordshire & Buckinghamshire, Burgess of New Windsor, Auditor of the Exchequer and Dorothy Gilbert, before 19 June 1589 at of Chilham, Kent, England; They had 4 daughters
2 CONC  (Anne, wife of Sir John Cutts; Dorothy, wife of Sir Thomas Chicheley; Mary, wife of Sir Dudley Digges; & Amy, wife of Sir Henry, 1st Baronet Skipwith).2,3,4,5,6,7,8 Sir Thomas Kempe died before 10 December 1607; Buried at Wye, Ke
2 CONC nt.2,4,7
2 CONT *'''Family 1      Anne d. b 19 Jun 1589
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Isaac Kempe10 b. 1 Oct 1586
2 CONT *'''Family 2      Dorothy Thompson b. c 1555
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Anna Kempe10 b. 19 Jun 1589
2 CONT **Amy Kempe2,11,4,5,7,8 b. 6 Aug 1591
2 CONT **Dorothy Kempe2 b. c 1592
2 CONT **Mary Kempe+12,2,3,4,6,7 b. c 1593
2 CONT *Citations
