1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Anne Sackville''' (1514-1554+) Anne Sackville was the daughter of John Sackville of Chiddingley, Kent (1484-September 27, 1557) and Margaret Boleyn (b.c.1487). By 1537, she married Sir Nicholas Pelham of Laughto
2 CONC n, Sussex (1517-September 15, 1560). They had ten children, including Sir John (1537-October 13, 1580), Mary, Anthony, Sir Thomas (c.1540-December 2, 1624), Robert, Anne, Elizabeth, Edward, and Nicholas (b.1554). Portrait: effigy 
2 CONC in St. Michael’s Church, Lewes, Sussex.
