2 CONC 9.  6. John Shelley of Michelgrove, Esq. the eldest son, married Mary, daughter of Sir William Fitz-Williams, Knt. and Maud his wife, daughter of Sir Richard Sackvile of Buckhurst, Knt. (who surviving him, married Sir Robert Gulde
2 CONC ford, Knt.) by whom he had two sons and six daughters; ....
