2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Henry Browne, Eleanor Shirley married secondly, by licence dated 15
2 CONT February 1546, William Sackville (d. 19 May 1556), eldest son of Edward Sackville of
2 CONT Bletchingley and Jane Kynaston, daughter of Sir Roger Kynaston, by whom she had a
2 CONT son, Edward Sackville, and a daughter, Mary Sackville, who married Thomas Dannett,
2 CONT esquire. After the death of William Sackville, Eleanor Shirley married a husband
2 CONT surnamed Gainsford. See Plantagenet Ancestry, supra, Vol. I, p. 413, and Surrey History
2 CONT Centre LM/1036/61, depositions made 4 June 1599 by Eleanor Gainsford, widow, and
2 CONT Edward Sackville, her son.
