1 NOTE {geni:about_me} . BENJAMIN3 BROWNE (William2, John1), son of (2) William2 and Magdalene (ELSICK) BROWNE, was born on 12 Oct. 1571 in Horley, Surrey[25], died on 28 Aug. 1638[20] and was buried on 28 Aug. 1638 in Ifield, Sussex[20]
2 CONC . He married in Horley, Surrey, on 8 Oct. 1596, SARAH LECHFORD[20], who was born circa 1575 in Charlewood, Surrey[1]. [1, 20]
2 CONT
