1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Family and Education==
2 CONT b. 1509/10, 2nd or 3rd s. of Sir Wistan Browne of Abbess Roding, Essex by Elizabeth, da. of William Mordaunt of Turvey, Beds. educ. ?Oxf.; M. Temple. m. by 1551, Joan, da. and h. of William Farrington of Lancs., wid. of Charles Bo
2 CONC oth and of Henry Becconshall of Becconshall, Lancs., d.s.p. Kntd. 2 Feb. 1567. He died on 16 May 1567. His heir was his great-nephew, Wistan Browne.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Offices Held==
2 CONT Lent reader, M. Temple 1554.
2 CONT
