1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/GQNT-PVR
2 CONT Brief Life History of Tobias John
2 CONT '''
2 CONT Tobias John Chapman was born in 1525, in Lancashire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Julianne Derebaugh in 1549, in Lancashire, England. They were the parents of at least 1 son. He died in 1583, in his hometown, at the age of 58.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''NOTE: Julianne remarried John Barker in 1557, and Tobias & Julianne's only documented son John was born in 1550.  It is likely that Tobias died prior to 1557, and not 1583 as shown in some unsourced records.'''
