1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''''Note: 
2 CONT There are TWO different John Barkers, sons of Richard, born in different regions of Suffolk; this John married Margaret Ann Mawle. The other John Barker of Sibton married Julianne Derehaugh.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to Margaret Mawle on May 26 1562 in Nayland, Suffolk, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Occupation:  clothmaker
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	1540 Suffolk, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Oct., 1588 Nayland Babergh District Suffolk, England
2 CONT
2 CONT John Barker was born in England about 1540. He was a cloth maker at Nayland, Suffolk. He married Margaret Mawle of Nayland on May 26, 1562 in their village. Margaret was the daughter of John Mawle and his wife Margaret of Stoke Na
2 CONC yland. John and Margaret had eleven children baptised at Nayland. He was prosperous, as can be seen by his will, in which he bequeaths five houses to members of his family, and says that other houses have been disposed of. The wil
2 CONC l was made on June 24, 1587 and John was buried at Nayland on October 22, 1588, in the churchyard of St. James Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Parents: Richard Barker (1505 - 1561) & Alice Barker (1510 - 1560)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Margaret Mawle Barker (1540 - 1590)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Alice Barker Bartlett*
2 CONT   John Barker (1563 - 1617)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: St James Churchyard Nayland Babergh District Suffolk, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: Ken Smith Record added: Aug 28, 2013 Find A Grave Memorial# 116226889
2 CONT
