1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The places of birth and death of this Thomas suggest that he is closely related to [https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Cocke/6000000000619406103 that Thomas].
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Cocke (son of William and Elizabeth) married and had a daughter, Eleanor, who was baptized in the Parish of Stottesdon. Thomas also had a son, Richard Cocke, who was baptized on December 13, 1597 in the Parish of Sidbury, w
2 CONC hich is just over one mile to the northeast of Pickthorn. On this cold winter day, the choice of the Parish of Sidbury was about 1/4 mile closer than the Parish of Stottesdon. It was this Richard Cocke of Pickthorn who would later
2 CONC  travel to Virginia.
2 CONT
