2 CONT Mary Arundell (née Lady Mary Wriothesley) (c. 1563 – c. June 1607, buried on 27 June 1607 at Tisbury, Wiltshire) was born in Wriothesley, Staffordshire, to Henry Wriothesley, 2nd Earl of Southampton and Mary Browne. She married in
2 CONC  1585, obtaining a marriage licence on 18 June[1], Thomas Arundell, 1st Baron Arundell of Wardour son of Sir Matthew Arundell and Margaret Willoughby. Lady Mary and Thomas had three children.
