2 CONT *'''note   summ. vp. to Parliament May 1615 in his father's Barony of Ibrackan; Commissioner for a General Visitation of Ireland 1615; Governor of co. Clare and Thomond in succession to his father 1615/6-39; Commissioner for the P
2 CONC resident of Munster in his father's absence 1618 and on his death 1624-25; Privy Councillor [I]; a supporter of Strafford
