2 CONT F, #59855, b. circa 1580, d. 1 December 1658
2 CONT
2 CONT      Lettice FitzGerald, Baroness Offaly was born circa 1580.2 She was the daughter of Gerald FitzGerald, Lord Garratt and Catherine Knollys.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She married Sir Robert Digby, son of Sir George Digby and Abigail Heveningham, circa 19 April 1598.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 1 December 1658.2
2 CONT
