1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Family and Education==
2 CONT b. 1 Nov. 1590, 1st s. of Rowland Williams of Llangibby Castle and Cecil, da. of Sir Edward Mansell† of Margam, Glam. educ. Jesus, Oxf. 1610; I. Temple 1612. m. (1) settlement 30 Oct. 1614, (with £1,300), Frances, da. of Sir Willi
2 CONC am Morgan* of Tredegar, Mon., s.p.; (2) by c.1623 (with £2,000), Anne, da. of Sir John Trevor I* of Plas Têg, Flints., 3s. 2da. suc. fa. 1612; kntd. 10 Apr. 1621. d. bet. 5/19 Mar. 1642. sig. Ch[arles] Willi[a]ms.
