2 CONC  of birth from his emigration record of 1638 Age: 32  Her Parents were Christopher Mansel of, Margam,Glamorganshire,Wales and Anne Worsley of Bouch, Lancashire, England Submission Search: 570414-100699140028 : CD-ROM: Pedigree Res
