1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The eldest son and heir of Sir Walter Rice of Newton by his wife Elizabeth Mansell was Henry Rice, to whom Charles l relinquished all the family estates in the possession of the crown.  He lived at Newton, married 
2 CONC Margaret, daughter of Sir Edward Lewis of Van and Blanche Morgan.
