2 CONT *Mother: Ursula NEVILLE
2 CONT *Married: Thomas DIGGES (Sir Knight) (b. ABT 1540 - d. 24 Aug 1595) (son of Leonard Digges and Bridget Wilford) ABT 1580
2 CONT *Children:
