2 CONT **2. Margaret DIGGES
2 CONT **3. Leonard DIGGES (b. ABT 1588 - d. 1635)
2 CONT **4. William DIGGES
2 CONT **5. Mary DIGGES
2 CONT **6. Ursula DIGGES
