1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Elizabeth Scot1
2 CONT *F, #148298
2 CONT *Last Edited=6 Jun 2005
2 CONT *'''     Elizabeth Scot is the daughter of Sir Thomas Scot.1 She married, firstly, John Knatchbull, son of Richard Knatchbull and Joan Sheaf.1 She married, secondly, Sir Richard Smythe.1
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Smythe.1 Her married name became Knatchbull.1
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S37] BP2003 volume 1, page 476. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p14830.htm#i148298 _____________
