2 CONT ===notes===
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://www.zipworld.com.au/~lnbdds/home/smythwilts.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. Sir Richard Smythe of Leeds Castle = Elizabeth Scott (d/o Sir Thomas Scott) (w/o John Knatchbull) (m 1589) = (2) Jane White (d/o John White of London) (w/o Samuel Thornhill) 
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - Sir Richard Smythe's mother had this to say in her Will: "To his [Sir Richard Smythe's] son Thomas Smith 100, and to John 50, to be paid on attaining the age of 21." 
2 CONT
2 CONT This son, Thomas (not listed below in the pre 2000 GenUK Essex pedigree) may have married Mary Smyth - a daughter fo the Smyth family of Ashton Court, (qv) Bristol.
