2 CONC ng. i. 162. 4. C181/1, ff. 90v, 92; 181/2, f. 300; 181/3, ff. 4, 42; 181/5, p. 519. 5. J.J.N. McGurk, ‘Letter Bk. regarding the Ltcy. of Kent, 1604-28’, Al. Cant. lxxxii. 131; J.R. Scott, Scott, of Scot’s-Hall, pp. xxii, xxviii. 6
