2 CONC . C212/22, 20-1, 23; SR, v. 63, 85. 9. C181/3, f. 175v; 181/4, f. 48; 181.5, f. 131v. 10. Harl. 6846, f. 37. 11. E. Kent Archives Cent. H1210, f. 73r-v. 12. C181/4, f. 88. 13. A. and O. i. 92, 113, 148, 231, 336, 451, 541, 620, 64
2 CONC 0; Cal. Assize Recs. Kent Indictments, Chas. I, 451, 467. 14. LPL, TG1, p. 28. 15. PROB 11/85, ff. 1-2; HMC Hatfield, xiv. 282. 16. HMC Hatfield, xxii. 14, 558. 17. E351/1950. On his Postling address, see Canterbury Mar. Lics. 156
