2 CONC hea Scott ed. G.D. Scull, 132, 135, 142. 22. CJ, i. 817b, 819b, 830a, 830a, 836a, 837a, 856a, 857a. 23. For the 1627 commn. see T. Rymer, Foedera, viii. pt. 2, p. 144. 24. Scott, p. xxx; APC, 1629-30, pp. 308-9 (name mis-spelt ‘St
2 CONC ot’). 25. Scott, p. xxxii. 26. CD 1628, iv. 345; v. 367. 27. CJ, i. 874a, 887b, 893a, 900a. 28. Scott, p. xxxiii. 29. P. Clark, Eng. Prov. Soc. 387-8. 30. A. Everitt, Community of Kent and Gt. Rebellion, 130, 156; HMC Pepys, 203. 
2 CONC 31. PROB 11/195, ff. 149-50v. 
