2 CONT * Parents: the third son of Sir Edward Gage, of Firle by his wife Elizabeth Parker
2 CONT * Married: Elizabeth, daughter of Sir Thomas Guldeforde, of Hempstead Place
2 CONT
2 CONT and had issue, 
2 CONT * 1. Sir John Gage, heir to his uncle John Gage, of Firle, and 1st Baronet Gage of Firley
2 CONT * 2. Mary, married first Sir William Pordage, of Radmersham, in Kent, and afterward, Thomas Ashfield, of Chesham, in Buckinghamshire; 
2 CONT * 3. Elizabeth, wife of Crisacre More, of More Hall, in Hertfordshire, great grandson and heir of the Chancellor More.
2 CONT
