2 CONC i. 105. 4. E. Suss. RO, Rye hundreds 1599-1606, ff. 387, 388; HMC 13th Rep. IV, 131; Suss. Arch. Colls. lix. 118. 5. PCC 25 Soame; Suss. Arch. Colls. v. 35, 102-3; xiv. 101; xvi. 189; xl. 2, 5, 7, 22; lix. 118, 122; DNB.
