1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Ann Honywood''' was born ABT 1577. She married John Wilde. She was the daughter of Robert Honywood and Elizabeth Browne. 
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://wc.rootsweb.com/trees/133862/I61881/ann-honywood/individual
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John Wilde. He was born 1575 in Kent, ENGLAND. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ann /Honywood/ and John /Wilde/ are:
2 CONT # Robert Wilde was born 1599.
2 CONT # Ann Wilde was born 1601.
2 CONT # John Wilde was born 1603.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Wilde was born 1605.
2 CONT # Hellen Wilde was born 1607.
2 CONT # Francis Wilde was born 1609.
2 CONT # Dudley Wilde was born 1611.
2 CONT # Hester Wilde was born 1613.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 'The posterity of Mary Honywood' at. https://fmg.ac/resources/scanned-sources/file/129-tpg1-397?start=20  (page 399), (page 403-404) 
2 CONT
2 CONT THE POSTERlTY OF MARY HONYWOOD. 399 (A.).-HONYWOOD. The saide Robert Honywood, by his second wife Elizabeth Browne, daughter to Sir Thomas Browne, of Beachworth Castle in Surrey, by his wife Mabell Fitz- Williams, one of the cohei
2 CONC res ?f Sir William Fitz-Williams, Lord Deputy of Ireland, had issue:
2 CONT
