2 CONT Brief Life History of John
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Glanville was born in 1562, in Launceston, Cornwall, England, United Kingdom, his father, Thomas Glanville, was 17 and his mother, Lady Joan Mary Cornish, was 15. He married Christian Eastcotte on 12 February 1587, in La
2 CONC unceston St Mary Magdalene, Cornwall, England. He died on 12 February 1616, in Launceston, Cornwall, England, at the age of 54, and was buried in St Mary Magdalene's Church, Launceston, Cornwall, England, United Kingdom.
