2 CONT Jenkin Conway married Mary, daughter of Sir William Herbert of the Colebrooke (Coldbrook) branch of the Herberts. (Burke-citation below)
2 CONT
2 CONT If Burke was correct that the Mary who married Jenkin Conway was the daughter of Sir William Herbert of Colebrook then this could only have been the William Herbert of Colebrook who was Knight of the Shire for Monmouth in 1547 and
2 CONC  who died after 1579 as this William was preceded by his father, Rhys Herbert of Colebrook and was succeeded by his son Matthew. This William married twice: (i) Denys dau. of Sir Edmund Agmondesham, and (2) Jane dau. of John ap Th
2 CONC omas John of Llangattog, and relict of James ap Watkin Griffith of Llanthony.
