2 CONT '''
2 CONT When Alice Barker was born on 5 April 1567, in Nayland, Suffolk, England, her father, John Barker, was 26 and her mother, Margaret Mawle, was 25. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Robert Bartlett on 6 October 1589, in Puddletown, Dorset, England, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1611, in Puddletown, Dorset, England, United Kingdom, at the age of 44, and was buried in Puddletown, Dorset, England, United Kingdom.
