1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Joyce-Frost/6000000002889155795?through=6000000218101353872
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Barker-15900
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Joyce Barker was the daughter of John Barker, a wealthy clothier of Nayland, Suffolk, England and his wife Margaret Mawle. She was probably born at baptised at Nayland. She was born after 1566 as she was under 21 years of age when
2 CONC  her father wrote his will in 1587. [1] Her father named her as fourth and last of his four youngest daughters (after Dorothy, Alice and Anne), indicating that she was probably much younger than 21 years of age, and left her two h
2 CONC undred pounds when she attained the age of 21 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joice was probably born after 1579 as she was not mentioned as a legatee of her grandfather John Mawle who made his will in that year and bequeathed ten pounds to every child of "my daughter Barker" who was then alive. [2] This be
2 CONC quest was reiterated in John Barker's will naming all his children who would receive that money; Joice was not listed.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # WikiTree contributors, "Joice Barker (aft.1579-)," WikiTree: The Free Family Tree, (https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Barker-15900 : accessed 28 April 2025).
2 CONT ##Will of John Barker: "England & Wales, Prerogative Court of Canterbury Wills, 1384-1858"
2 CONT The National Archives; Kew, Surrey, England; Records of the Prerogative Court of Canterbury, Series PROB 11; Class: PROB 11; Piece: 73 Ancestry Sharing Link - Ancestry uk Record 5111 #925644 (accessed 6 March 2023)
2 CONT Will of Johannis Barker, granted probate on 10 Dec 1588. Died about 1588 in Nayland, Suffolk, England.
2 CONT ##Will of John Mawle 1579: "England & Wales, Prerogative Court of Canterbury Wills, 1384-1858"
2 CONT The National Archives; Kew, Surrey, England; Records of the Prerogative Court of Canterbury, Series PROB 11; Class: PROB 11; Piece: 62 Ancestry Sharing Link - Ancestry uk Record 5111 #960534 (accessed 6 March 2023)
2 CONT Will of Johis Mawle, granted probate on 26 Jan 1579. Died about 1579 in Nayland, Suffolk, England.
