1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LBS2-J68
2 CONT Brief Life History of John'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Chapman was born in 1550, in Cratfield, Suffolk, England, his father, Tobias John Chapman, was 25 and his mother, Julianne Derebaugh, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elsabeth Goodlad in 1568, in St Margaret, Westminster, Middlesex, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 1 daughter. 
2 CONT Nicholas Chapman 1571-1620
2 CONT Emma Chapman 1572-1606
2 CONT Thomas Chapman 1575-
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1583, in Colchester, Essex, England, at the age of 33.
