2 CONT Richard Cocke was several times a member of the House of Burgesses and County Lieutenant of Henrico. He amassed considerable means for the times in which he lived. Planter and politician, his sons and grandsons at one time or anot
2 CONC her occupied nearly every office of dignity and profit in Henrico County.<br>
2 CONT Married to Elizabeth, Temperance Baley, and Mary Aston. Children were Thomas, Richard, William, Elizabeth with Temperance. Richard, John, William, Elizabeth with Mary.<br>
