1 NAME Thomas /Wriothesley/
2 GIVN Thomas
2 SURN Wriothesley
2 _MARNM Wriothesley
1 NAME Thomas Wriothesley, 4th Earl of Southampton
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 10 MAR 1607
2 ADDR
3 CITY Titchfield
3 STAE England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 16 MAY 1667
2 PLAC Southampton House, Bloomsbury
