2 CONT Richard Lugg
2 CONT Rec. 25 May 1659
2 CONT
2 CONT p.186. Francis Browne of Rapa., "with consent of Elizabeth my wife confirms all my right & claim" to that 300 acres formerly sold "unto Roger Radford unto Nicholas Cocke his heirs or his assigns" and releases claim to sd land. Dat
2 CONC ed 15 May 1659. signed
2 CONT Francis Browne
2 CONT Eliz Browne
2 CONT Wit:
