2 CONT No.2. p.92 Will of John Baxter. Dated "tenth of december at night". Probated 6 January 1645/6. All goods to Eliz: Clarke. Lists debts due him as follows: Thomas Beale 300 and odd John Pellam 160 Charles Smith 90 Mr Lee a pair of s
2 CONC hoes Francis the Frenchman a pair of shoes. Signed
2 CONT John Baxter
2 CONT His marke
