2 CONC  on the So: Side of Puscatacon Creeke in the County of Rappa. begining at a marked pocickry standing by or nigh adjoyning to the Eastermost tree of FRANCIS BROWNE & Extending its Demensions for Breadth So:So: E: 56 chaines by a Li
2 CONC ne of marked trees dividing this land and a parcell of land belonging to and in the possession of one THOMAS HARPER to a marked corner red oake thence by and alonge the land of SAMLL. PERRY So:So: West 320 chaynes doubling its Lea
