2 CONC ed doe hereby give assigne & make over all the land menconed in this patt to the sd Mary Clapham & Peter Carter aforesd Equally to be devided betweene them according to its quantity and the said Mary Clapham to have her first choy
2 CONC ce thereof To Have and to Hold to them & their heires for Ever and yt: if either Dye before marriage or of aige the Survivor to Enjoy the whole to him or her his or her heires or assignes for Ever in as large & ample manner to all
