2 CONT BE IT KNOWNE UNTO ALL MEN by these presents that I LT. COLLO, THOMAS GOODRICH for myselfe my heires and assignes doe by these presents release and for Ever quite clayme all my right title and interrest clayme & demand wtsoever wch
2 CONC  I now have of into or concerning 1100 acres of land scituate lying and being on the South side of Puscatacon Creeke or the Branches thereof unto FRANCIS BROWNE and his heires for Ever wch said land was formerly granted unto the s
2 CONC aid Francis Browne by Patt. and is now in his Possession to the true performance whereof I the said Lt. Collo Thomas Goodrich doe oblidge myselfe my heires unto the said Francis Browne in the just sume of Twenty thousand pounds of
2 CONC  Tobo: by Vertue of these presents GIVEN under my hand and seale this 3d of March 1667
