2 CONC lly the Rents & services thereby due & payable according to the Pattent & lastly the sd THOMAS GOLDMAN doth hereby prmise to Ratifie & confirme the above bargained prmises with sufficient warranty & assurance by acknowledgment in 
2 CONC the County Court of Rappa. & alsoe that ALLICE GOLDMAN my welbeloved Wife shall alsoe acknowledge and surrender her interest in the above bargained land and prmises to the use and behoofe of the sd WILLM. CLEATON his heires & assi
2 CONC gnes for ever. Witness my hand &seale the day & yeare first above mentioned.
