2 CONT *_____________________
2 CONT *William Paulet, 4th Marquess of Winchester (bef. 1560 – 4 February 1628) was the son of William Paulet, 3rd Marquess of Winchester and Agnes Howard. He married Lady Lucy Cecil, daughter of Sir Thomas Cecil, 1st Earl of Exeter and
2 CONC  Dorothy Neville. Lucy and William had six children:
2 CONT **'''''' William Paulet, Lord St John (1587/8–1621), married Mary Browne, daughter of Anthony-Maria Browne, 2nd Viscount Montagu
2 CONT ** Lord Thomas Paulet (d. bef. 1621)
2 CONT ** John Paulet, 5th Marquess of Winchester (c.1598–1675) married 1) Jane Savage, daughter of Thomas Savage, 1st Viscount Savage, and 2) Honora de Burgh, daughter of Richard Burke, 4th Earl of Clanricarde.
2 CONT ** Lord Henry Paulet, of Amport, married Lucy Philpot, daughter of Sir George Philpot of Thruxton
2 CONT ** Lord Charles Paulet (d. c.1654), had issue
2 CONT ** Lord Edward Paulet
