2 CONT *''''''Married 2: Robert PETRE (3º B. Petre of Writtle) 1620
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. William PETRE (4º B. Petre of Writtle)
2 CONT **2. John PETRE (5º B. Petre of Writtle)
2 CONT **3. Thomas PETRE (6º B. Petre of Writtle)
