2 CONT 33 Joan SAVAGE: (ancestor of Lizzie Borden)
2 CONT
2 CONT chr 18 Feb 1609 Wilford Parish, Hertfordshire, England;
2 CONT
2 CONT d Aft 15 Sep 1699 Portsmouth, Newport, RI.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 1605 in Exeter, DEV, ENG (probably) 1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 14 Jan 1677/78 in Portsmouth, Newport, RI (wp) 1 2 3 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Margaret Brown 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1638 He is at Portsmouth
2 CONT
2 CONT 30 Apr 1639 With others, oath of allegiance to Charles I
2 CONT
2 CONT 7 Jan 1639/40 With partner Wilbur "Samuel Wildbore", erects 1st sawmill/planer
2 CONT
2 CONT 1647 Licensed to keep a hotel, sell wine & beer and to entertain strangers
2 CONT
