2 CONT **Mathewes, Manesseh	cler. fil. Jesus Coll., matric. 9 Aug., 1658 (subs. Manesses), rector of Port Eynon 1662, vicar of Swansea 1670, and of Llangevelach (all co. Glamorgan) 1677; father of the next. See Foster's Index Eccl.
