1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Cecilia Croftes''' was the daughter of Sir John Croftes and Mary Shirley.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Thomas Killegrew.1 She died on 1 January 1638.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Maid of Honour to Queen Henrietta Maria.1 Her married name became Killegrew.
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations [http://www.thepeerage.com/p37566.htm#i375653 The Peerage] 1.[S47] Hugh Montgomery-Massingberd, editor, Burke's Irish Family Records (London, U.K.: Burkes Peerage Ltd, 1976), page 292. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Irish 
2 CONC Family Records. 2.[S47] Hugh Montgomery-Massingberd, Burke's Irish Family Records.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Cecilia Crofts (16??-1638) in 1636, a maid of honour to Queen Henrietta Maria with a son:
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Killigrew (bapt 16 April 1637 St Martin's-in-the-Fields) 
2 CONT
