1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Henry Skipwith, a lawyer, became 2nd Baronet of Prestwold on the death of his father. After the Civil War in England he went out to Masulipatam on the South East Coast of India. He died there, unmarried, in 1656, a
2 CONC t which time the Baronetcy passed to his younger brother Graye/gGrey Skipwith.
