2 CONT *Sir Grey Humberston d'Estoteville Skipwith, 11th Baronet (1884–1950)
2 CONT *Sir Patrick Alexander d'Estoteville Skipwith, 12th Baronet (born 1938)
2 CONT *The heir apparent to the baronetcy is Alexander Sebastian Grey d'Estoteville Skipwith (born 1969).
2 CONT * .... etc.
