1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Robert Kemp was born on October 14, 1649 in Kirby, Fleetham, Yorkshire, England to Henry Kemp and Elizabeth (MNU) Kemp.  Robert married Elizabeth Webb on July 6, 1678 in Bolton, Talbot County, Maryland, United Stat
2 CONC es and had 7 children:  Rachel Kemp, John Kemp, Elizabeth Kemp, Edmond Kemp, Jane Kemp, Sarah Kemp, and William Kemp.  He passed away on October 30, 1702 in Bay Hundred, Talbot County, Maryland, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Kemp is my 8th great grandfather.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LZJQ-N85'''
2 CONT Brief Life History of Robert
2 CONT
2 CONT When Robert Kemp was born on 14 October 1649, in Kirkby Fleetham, Yorkshire, England, his father, Edmund Kemp, was 19 and his mother, Elizabeth, was 15. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elizabeth Webb on 6 September 1678, in Talbot, Maryland, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT John 1680-1751
2 CONT Elizabeth 1683-1744
2 CONT Edmond 1685-
2 CONT Jane 1686-1745
2 CONT Rachel 1688-
2 CONT Sarah 1690-
2 CONT William 1629-1729
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 30 October 1702, in Talbot, Maryland, British Colonial America, at the age of 53, and was buried in Talbot, Maryland, British Colonial America.
