1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Lewis/6000000000151453567
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne SACKVILLE, daughter of  Sir Thomas SACKVILLE Earl of Dorset and Cicily Baker, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 was born 1564 in Withyham, Sussex, England. She married Sir Henry GLEMHAM Knight on 28 Sep 1585 in St. John the Baptist, Lewes, Su
2 CONC ssex, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *M	i	 Sir Thomas GLEMHAM Knight 1, 2, 3 was born 1587 in Glemham, Suffolk, England. He died 1649 in Zutphen, Gelderland, Netherlands.
2 CONT *F	ii	 Anne GLEMHAM was christened 8 Feb 1589 and died 10 Jan 1639.
2 CONT *F	iii	 Mary GLEMHAM 1 was born 1591 in Little Glemham, Suffolk, England.
2 CONT *F	iv	 Cecily GLEMHAM was christened 1 13 Jun 1594 in St. Bride Fleet Street, London, Middlesex, England.
2 CONT *M	v	 Henry GLEMHAM Bishop of St. Asaph 1, 2, 3 was born 1596 in Glemham, Suffolk, England. He died 17 Jan 1670 in Glemham, Suffolk, England.
2 CONT *F	vi	 Elizabeth GLEMHAM 1 was born 1599 in Little Glemham, Suffolk, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Link:  http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~hwbradley/aqwg3302.htm#88873
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Comments'''
2 CONT
2 CONT As of October 2017, http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/SACKVILLE.htm#Anne SACKVILLE2 site claims incorrectly that Anne, daughter of the 2nd Earl of Dorset, married https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-Henry-Glemham-Kt-MP/6000000012806168089?
2 CONC through=6000000006602669013 as her 3rd husband.  Henry Glemham in fact married her aunt Anne, daughter of the 1st Earl of Dorset and his wife Cicily Baker.
