2 CONT Lady Mary Sackville married Henry Neville, 7th Lord Abergavenny, son of Edward Neville, 6th Lord Abergavenny and Rachel Lennard, before 1601.1
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Thomas Sackville, 1st Earl of Dorset and Cecily Baker.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From before 1601, her married name became Neville.[1]
