2 CONT
2 CONT Deathe first did strike Sr John heare tom’d in claye
2 CONT And then enforst his sonne to follow faste
2 CONT Of Pelham’s line this knyghte was chiefe and Staye
2 CONT By this behold all fleshe must dye at last
2 CONT But Blesowes lord thy sister most may moane
2 CONT Both mate and sonn hathe left her heare alone.
2 CONT Sir John Pelham died the 13 of October 1580
2 CONT Oliver Pelham his sonne dyed ye 19 of January 1584
