2 CONT Sir John Gage 1st Baronet of Firle And 1st Viscount 1571-1633
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on John Gage:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p15282.htm#i152818
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Gage, 1st Bt. [1]
2 CONT *M, #152818, 
2 CONT *d. 3 October 1633
2 CONT *Last Edited=9 Apr 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Gage, 1st Bt. was the son of Thomas Gage and Elizabeth Guilford.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Penelope Darcy, daughter of Thomas Darcy, 1st Earl Rivers and Mary Kitson, circa 28 June 1611.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 3 October 1633.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was created 1st Baronet Gage, of Firley, co. Sussex [England] on 26 March 1622.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir John Gage, 1st Bt. and Penelope Darcy
2 CONT *1. Sir Thomas Gage, 2nd Bt.+[2] d. 2 Jul 1654
2 CONT *2. Frances Gage [4] d. c 29 Dec 1695
2 CONT *3. John Gage [2]
2 CONT *4. Henry Gage+[2]
2 CONT *5. Penelope Gage [2]
2 CONT *6. Elizabeth Gage [2]
2 CONT *7. Anne Gage [2]
2 CONT *8. Sir Edward Gage, 1st Bt.+[2] b. 1617, d. 31 Jan 1707
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 507. Hereinafter cited as Burke's P
2 CONC eerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT *2. [S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 2, page 1500.
2 CONT *3. [S15] George Edward Cokayne, editor, The Complete Baronetage, 5 volumes (no date (c. 1900); reprint, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 1983), volume I, page 193. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Baronetage.
2 CONT *4. [S47] Hugh Montgomery-Massingberd, editor, Burke's Irish Family Records (London, U.K.: Burkes Peerage Ltd, 1976). Hereinafter cited as Burke's Irish Family Records.
