1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne Love Married 1) Lunsford 2) as 1st wife of 4 to Sir John Morgan, of Chilworth in Bramley, Sussex; and their daughter and heiress Anne Morgan (named in John Love's 1593 will) married '''Sir Edward Randyll, of A
