2 CONT >John Love, of Winchelsey, dec d , was owner of these premises, and he had issue 2 dau'rs, viz 1. Margaret, who married to the said Oliver St.John, and another to Sir John Morgan, Knt. and died leaving issue only the said Ann, wif
2 CONC e of the af d Sir Edward Randyll. 
