2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Nicholas le Strange was born circa 1562.1 He was the son of Hamon le Strange and Elizabeth Hastings.1 He married, firstly, Mary Bell, daughter of Sir Robert Bell, in 1582.1 He married, secondly, Anne Paston, daughter of Sir Wi
2 CONC lliam Paston and Mary Clere, in 1591.1 He died on 15 December 1591.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Nicholas le Strange lived at Hunstanton, Norfolk, England.2 He held the office of Member of Parliament (M.P.) for Norfolk.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Sir Nicholas le Strange and Mary Bell
