1 NAME Thomas Preston, 1st Viscount Tara
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1585
2 PLAC Of, Gormanston, Meath, Ireland
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 7 MAR 1654
