1 NAME John Lamotte /Honeywood/ MP
2 GIVN John Lamotte
2 SURN Honeywood
2 NSFX MP
2 _MARNM Honeywood
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1647
1 BAPM
2 DATE 21 MAY 1647
1 DEAT
