2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of John
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Glanville was born on 28 November 1599, in St Stephens, Cornwall, England, United Kingdom, his father, John Glanville, was 37 and his mother, Mary Skirrett, was 32. He married Grace Hallamore in 1615, in Brixham, Torbay,
2 CONC  Devon, England, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 1 daughter. He died on 20 October 1631, in Saltash, Cornwall, England, United Kingdom, at the age of 31, and was buried in St Germans, Cornwall, England,
2 CONC  United Kingdom.
