2 CONT # JAMES BROWN, b. England; d. 1683.
2 CONT # JEREMIAH BROWN, b. England; d. 1690.
2 CONT # CHAD BROWN, d. May 10, 1663.
2 CONT # DANIEL BROWN.
2 CONT # JOHN BROWN, b. 1630, England; d. 1706.
2 CONT
