2 CONC rges on May 25, 1609 in Twineham, Sussex, England (England and Wales marriages 1538-1940) . She married second William Browne on August 20, 1611 in Rusper, Sussex, England (England, Select Marriages 1538-1973). Jane emigrated to A
2 CONC merica with William & their family in 1646 but died of smallpox on the voyage.
