1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LRM1-9LT/henry-browne-1626-1703
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Henry
2 CONT
2 CONT When Henry Browne was christened on 20 December 1626, in Rusper, Sussex, England, United Kingdom, his father, William Brown, was 41 and his mother, Jane Mills, was 30. He married Waite Waterman in 1660, in Providence, Providence, 
2 CONC Rhode Island, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 2 daughters. He died on 20 February 1703, in Providence, Providence, Rhode Island, United States, at the age of 76, and was buried in Providence, Providence
2 CONC , Rhode Island, United States.
2 CONT
