2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Browne was born in 1626 in Rusper, Sussex, England. He was the son of William Browne and Jane Burgis (Mills) Browne. He married Wait (Waterman) Browne in about 1660. They were married sometime between 1655 and 1665. He passe
2 CONC d away in 1703 in Providence, Providence County, Rhode Island.
2 CONT
