2 CONT
2 CONT Elieazer, child of Abraham Graves & Anna Graves, was born on 10 March 1689 in Andover, Massachusetts.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Eliazer married Sarah Dunton on 9 November 1709 in Andover, Essex, Massachusetts, United States.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleazer died intestate and his probate file was dated 22 April 1745. [3]
