2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Graves was born on December 22, 1718, in Boston, Suffolk County, Massachusetts, the son of Ebenezer and Sarah Graves.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Graves/Greaves and Sarah Bailey were married on September 6, 1744, in Marblehead, Essex County, Massachusetts.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on January 9, 1754.
