2 CONT ===Hannah (Abbot) Osgood (abt. 1685 - 1774)===
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Osgood formerly Abbot
2 CONT
2 CONT Born about 27 Feb 1685 in Andover, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of George Abbott Jr and Dorcas (Graves) Abbott
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Sarah Abbot, Joseph Abbot, Nathan Abbott, Martha Abbot, Daniel Abbott, Elizabeth (Abbot) Abbott, George Abbott III, Henry Abbot Jr and Isaac Abbot Sr
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Osgood — married 16 Sep 1708 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Hannah (Osgood) Chickering and John Osgood
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 25 Dec 1774 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT * Vital Records Of Andover Massachusetts, to the End of the Year 1849. Vol. I Births. Topsfield, Mass.: The Topsfield Historical Society, 1912. p. 28
2 CONT * 2.0 2.1 2.2 "Abbot Genealogy." The Essex antiquarian; a quarterly magazine devoted to the biography, genealogy, history and antiquities of Essex County, Massachusetts. Volume 1 p. 36. Salem, Mass.:1897.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Andover/cBirthsA.shtml "(ABBOT (Abbet, Abbett, Abbott, Abbut, Abbutt, Abett)) Hannah, d. George and Dorcas (Graves), Feb, 27, 1684."
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Andover/cMarriagesA.shtml "(ABBOTT (Abbet, Abbett, Abbot) Hannah, and John Osgood, Sept. 16, 1708."
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Andover/aDeathsO.shtml "(Osgood) Hannah (Abbott), wid. Maj. John, Dec. 26, 1774, a. 89 y. GR1"
2 CONT
