1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha, daughter of John Bond and Emma Graves, was born 25 August 1686 in Gloucester, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT On 19 March 1705/6, Martha married Isaac Sawyer, son of James Sawyer and Sarah Bray, in Gloucester, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony. They had eight children between 1707-1724. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret died after the birth of her last child on 20 August 1724. [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Name
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha was born Martha Bond. After her father's death, her mother married Benjamin Haskell. Haskell was not Martha's biological father and not her middle name or last name.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bond-5508
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Martha (Bond) Sawyer (1686 - aft. 1724)===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 25 Aug 1686 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of John Bond and Emma (Graves) Haskell
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Elizabeth (Bond) Pride and Edward Bond I
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Isaac Sawyer — married 19 Mar 1705 in Gloucester, Essex, Province of Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Isaac Sawyer, Edward Sawyer, Thomas Sawyer, Martha Sawyer, Abraham Sawyer, Judith Sawyer, Elisabeth Sawyer and Judith Sawyer
2 CONT
2 CONT Died after 20 Aug 1724 at about age 37 in Gloucester, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 2 Oct 2021 | Created 19 Dec 2017
2 CONT
