2 CONC HE WAS BORN THE 10th DA[Y OF D]ECEMBER 1639 AND D[E]PARTE[D L]IFE THE 20th OF NOVEMBER 17[06].); d. November 20, 1706, Bremo, Henrico, Virginia.
