2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Richard COCKE, The Younger b: Abt. 1657 in Settled at "Old Man's Creek", Charles City Co d: 1720 in Bremo, Henrico Co, VA (will presented in court Oct 1720 by Ebenezar Adams)
2 CONT
2 CONT married:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. possibly a first marriage to Elizabeth Littlebury
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : Elizabeth ?
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. +Anne COCKE m. Robert Bolling ll
2 CONT
2 CONT    2.  Richard COCKE , Jr. 1670-1749
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Anne BOWLER b: January 23, 1674/75 d: April 24, 1705
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Thomas Bowler, Esq 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Rebecca Bowler sister to Anne.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.jscott.tierranet.com/ancestry/stith/jcanant/cocke.htm
