2 CONT
2 CONT etc 1697-1704 page 162 where same John Cocke husband of Obedience
2 CONT
2 CONT signed a release recorded 1 Jun 1700, but next release was her sister 
2 CONT
2 CONT Priscilla's release dated in 1699 recorded also 1 Jun 1700--so we are forced 
2 CONT
2 CONT to go with the estate inventory order of 2 Oct 1699 saying John Cocke was 
2 CONT
2 CONT already dead;
2 CONT
