2 CONC ventory of Mr. John Cocke appraised 27 Oct. 1699 by court order of 2 Oct. 1699, by Thomas Edwards,... Value L 102/15/00 presented in court by Obedience, relict and executrix of John Cocke, Recorded 1 Aug. 1700. Adventurers of Purs
2 CONC e and Person 1607-1625, 3rd ed. 1987 revised and edited by Virginia m. Meyer and John Frederick Dorman, p. 97 says that their marriage in 1696 is recorded in Henrico Deeds and Wills Bk 1688-1697 page 710 and John's death probated 
