2 CONT *''''''F, #15291, d. 1680
2 CONT *Last Edited=23 Sep 2010
2 CONT *''''''Lady Elizabeth Wriothesley was the daughter of Thomas Wriothesley, 4th Earl of Southampton and Rachel de Massue.1 She married Edward Noel, 1st Earl of Gainsborough, son of Baptist Noel, 3rd Viscount Campden and Hon. Hester 
2 CONC Wotton, in May 1661.1 She died in 1680.2
2 CONT *''''''     From May 1661, her married name became Noel.
2 CONT *''''''Children of Lady Elizabeth Wriothesley and Edward Noel, 1st Earl of Gainsborough
2 CONT ** 1.Lady Frances Noel+3 d. 29 Sep 1684
2 CONT ** 2.Lady Jane Noel+3 d. Sep 1733
2 CONT ** 3.Wriothesley Baptist Noel, 2nd Earl of Gainsborough+3 b. b 1665, d. 21 Sep 1690
2 CONT *Citations
