2 CONT *Last Edited=23 Sep 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis Browne, 4th Viscount Montagu married Lady Mary Herbert, daughter of William Herbert, 1st Marquess of Powis and Lady Elizabeth Somerset, circa 1690.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in April 1708, without issue.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Francis Browne, 3rd Viscount Montagu.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He gained the title of 4th Viscount Montagu.
2 CONT
