2 CONT Sources: 1.Abbrev: Internet Title: Internet Page: http://members.aol.com/eurostamm/camilla.html 2.Abbrev: Painted Ladies Title: Painted Ladies, Women at the Court of Charles II by Catharine MacLeod and Julia Marciari Alexander, wi
2 CONC th Essays by Kevin Sharpe, Diana Dethloff and Sonya Wynne, National Portrait Gallery, London in association with Yale Center for British Art, New Haven. 2001.
2 CONT
2 CONT I highly recommend this book as it has beautiful pictures on almost every page. Page: . Text: .
2 CONT
2 CONT ...Eldest daughter of Edward Somerset, 2nd Marquess of Worcester and his first wife Elizabeth (nee Dormer), Anne was born in October 1631 and married, shortley before 21 October 1652, Henry Howard, second son of Henry Frederick Ho
2 CONC ward, Earl of Arundel. Howard, whose second wife was Jane Bickerton (q.v.), succeeded his brother as 6th Duke of Norfolk in 1677. Lady Anne's younger sister Elizabeth was later Countess then Marchioness of Powis (q.v.). Lady Anne 
2 CONC died in 1662...
