2 CONC carkey, Co. Tipp., and dau. and heiress of Conor O’Dwyer, Chief of his nation, by Giles, dau. of Maurice Fitzgibbon, the White Knight. His 2nd wife Onora, dau. of John Butler of Ardmayle, Co. Tipp. Honora Butler nee O’Dwyer mar. 2
