2 CONC ecords. Ir. Gen. Vol I, No. 9, p. 265, Thomas Blackall’s bro. George settled in Dublin, of which he was Lord Mayor in 1694. The latter’s gr. son, Sir Thomas Blackall, was Lord Mayor in 1769.
