2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT 129. John Mac Gilla Patraic of Castletown
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1601 and 1612, John is mentioned as of Garran; but soon after the latter date he removed to Castletown, where he continued to reside until his death, on the 25th July, 1626.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Lawrence John Fitzpatrick of Castletown, Col.,''' was born in 1640 in Castletown, Laois, Ireland, Ulster, Ireland. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34625227497 Florence MacShawn Fitzpatrick] and [https://www.geni.
2 CONC com/profile-34740635496 Bridget Fitzpatrick]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lawrence John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-30067617293 Elizabeth Fitzpatrick] circa 1660 in Castletown, Laois, Ireland. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-120619904 Hugh McDonald Fitzpatrick]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-30036846293 Richard Fitzpatrick, 1st Baron Gowran]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-30066105293 Edward Fitzpatrick, Gen.]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-30072864293 Arabella Wiseman]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 24, 1694, in Castletown, County Laois, Ireland, Castletown, County Laois, Ireland and was buried in Laois, Ireland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.fitz-patrickmythology.com/manuscript.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT See also: http://sources.nli.ie/Record/MS_UR_012404
