2 CONC , David Gr. ap John and David Gr. William Morris val. per annum.
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation 4:
2 CONT
2 CONT John Vaughan was born abt. 1570 in Pembrey, Carmarthenshire, Wales. He married Margaret Hopkins Dawkins.
2 CONT
2 CONT A Lease in the Cawdor Books (Golden Grove) find below;
2 CONT
2 CONT 1- Hopkin Dawkin of Lanridian Co. Glam Gentleman
2 CONT
2 CONT 2- John Vaughan of Pembrey  Gent., Margaret his wife, and sons Walter, Rowland and Francis Vaughan.
