2 CONT Generation 19:
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince Moreiddig Warwyn, Lord of Moreiddig of Brecon, England was born about 1150 in Bredwardine, Herefordshire, England. He was called “of the fair neck”. According to tradition a snake crawled into the mouth of Moreiddig’s mothe
2 CONC r as she lay sleeping while pregnant with him, and the child was born with the snake about its neck. 
