2 CONC her leaving by Honora daughter and heir to Ravenscroft os Bretton in the county of Flint Esq an only child Honora married to Sir John Glynne of Hawarden Castle in the same County Bart and one daughter Margaretta married to Sir Tho
2 CONC mas Longueville of Eastclusham in the county of Denbigh Bart
