1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography and family==
2 CONT From an unidentified source:
2 CONT
2 CONT >Frances Fortescue, 1st dau. of Sir John Fortescue, 2nd Bt., of Salden, co. Buckingham '''(by his first wife Hon Margaret Arundell''', 5th dau. by his second wife of Thomas [Arundell], 1st Baron Arundell of Wardour), 1st son and h
2 CONC eir of Sir John Fortescue, 1st Bt., of Salden, co. Buckingham, by his wife and second cousin Frances Stanley, 1st dau. and cohrss. of Sir Edward Stanley KB, of Eynsham, co. Oxford, and Tong Castle, co. Shropshire (by his wife Lady
2 CONC  Lucy Percy, 3rd dau. and cohrss. of Blessed Thomas [Percy], 1st Earl of Northumberland), only son and heir of Sir Thomas Stanley, of Winwick, co. Lancaster (by his wife Margaret Vernon, 2nd dau. and cohrss. of Sir George Vernon, 
2 CONC of Haddon Hall, co. Derby), 2nd son by his first wife of Edward [Stanley], 3rd Earl of Derby. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Date and place of marriage have also been (erroneously?) reported to be May 18, 1657 at Mursley, Buckinghamshire, England <attestation unknown, conflicts with Stirnet's "Fortescue02" page>.
2 CONT
