1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Oxenbridge-36
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Langhorne formerly Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Born 15 Aug 1602 in Warwickshire, England
2 CONT * Daughter of Daniel Oxenbridge MD and Katherine (Harby) Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Sister of Elizabeth (Oxenbridge) St John, Daniel Oxenbridge, Clement Oxenbridge, John Oxenbridge, Catherine (Oxenbridge) Skippon and Dorcas (Oxenbridge) Hunt	
2 CONT * Wife of William Langhorne Bt. — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT * Mother of Elizabeth Langhorne, William Langhorne Bt, Daniel Langhorne and Thomas Langhorne
2 CONT * Died [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT William Langorne, esq, Alderman of London, and a staunch Royalist, acquired a large fortune in the Levant trade; and died 1654. Married Mary (who married 2ndly, Capt. Thomas Ingoldsby, brother of Sir Richard Ingoldsby, the Parliam
2 CONC entarian general, and died in 1686 at Great Staughton, co Hunts), daughter o Daniel Oxenbridge, M.D., by Katherine, sister sir Job Harby, bart.; and had issue: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *     Sir William 
2 CONT *     Rev. Daniel 
2 CONT *     Elizabeth 
2 CONT
2 CONT Named in the will of her brother, Daniel Oxenbridge, dated 1 Feb 1643
