1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Elizabeth Oxenbridge1
2 CONT *F, #569144
2 CONT *Last Edited=24 Mar 2014
2 CONT *'''     Elizabeth Oxenbridge is the daughter of Daniel Oxenbridge and Katherine Harby.2,3 She married, firstly, Caleb Cockcroft. She married, thirdly, Sir Humphrey Sydenham. She married, secondly, Sir Oliver St. John, son of Oliv
2 CONC er St. John and Sarah Buckley, on 1 October 1645.1
2 CONT *'''     She was Northamptonshire.1 She lived Cholworthy.1 Somerset).1 She lived Daventry.1 Her married name became Sydenham. Her married name became Cockcroft. From 1 October 1645, her married name became St. John.1
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S37] BP2003 volume 3, page 3484. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT * 2.[S37] BP2003. [S37]
2 CONT * 3.[S18] Matthew H.C.G., editor, Dictionary of National Biography on CD-ROM (Oxford, U.K.: Oxford University Press, 1995). Hereinafter cited as Dictionary of National Biography.
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p56915.htm#i569144
2 CONT *________________________
