1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Oxenbridge-50
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Born about 1606 in England
2 CONT * Son of Daniel Oxenbridge MD and Katherine (Harby) Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Brother of Mary (Oxenbridge) Langhorne, Elizabeth (Oxenbridge) St John, Clement Oxenbridge, John Oxenbridge, Catherine (Oxenbridge) Skippon and Dorcas (Oxenbridge) Hunt	
2 CONT * [spouse(s) unknown]
2 CONT * [children unknown]
2 CONT * Died about 1 Feb 1643 at about age 37 in London, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Oxenbridge of London, resident and merchant of Liverne, made his will on 1 Feb 1643, naming executors John Throckmorton, Charles Longland, and John Collyer. Also named were his mother; brother John Oxenbridge, minister, and
2 CONC  his wife and sons; brother, Clement Oxenbridge; sister, wife of William Langhorne and their son Daniel; sister, wife of Caleb Cockcroft; sister, wife of Mr. Hunt; sister, Mrs. Catherine Henly and her daughter Katherine Fowler; co
2 CONC usins, friends, servants, and others.
