2 CONT
2 CONT Clement Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Born about 1609 in England
2 CONT * Son of Daniel Oxenbridge MD and Katherine (Harby) Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Brother of Mary (Oxenbridge) Langhorne, Elizabeth (Oxenbridge) St John, Daniel Oxenbridge, John Oxenbridge, Catherine (Oxenbridge) Skippon and Dorcas (Oxenbridge) Hunt	
2 CONT * [spouse(s) unknown]
2 CONT * [children unknown]
2 CONT * Died [date unknown] in England
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Named in the will of his brother, Daniel Oxenbridge, dated 1 Feb 1643. Possibly one of the founders of the English post office service.
