2 CONT * Born about 1612 in England
2 CONT * Daughter of Daniel Oxenbridge MD and Katherine (Harby) Oxenbridge
2 CONT * Sister of Mary (Oxenbridge) Langhorne, Elizabeth (Oxenbridge) St John, Daniel Oxenbridge, Clement Oxenbridge, John Oxenbridge and Dorcas (Oxenbridge) Hunt	
