1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary Digges Page BIRTH	1658 Charles City County, Virginia, USA DEATH	18 Mar 1690 (aged 31–32) Williamsburg City, Virginia, USA BURIAL	 Bruton Parish Episcopal Church Cemetery Williamsburg, Williamsburg City, Virgin
