2 CONT Married: 21 May 1680 in Lancaster, colony of Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-194147221-1-500308/mary-ann-pullen-rogers-born-stott-in-myheritage-family-trees
2 CONT * Mary's birth, marriage, and death information are available at https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LCQN-RX2
2 CONT * Mary and Henry were married on 21 May 1680 in Lancaster, Lancaster County, Colony of Virginia, British America.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Ann Pullen Rogers (born Stott) was born in 1672, in Lancaster, Lancaster, Virginia, United States, to Bryant Stott, Sr, Justice and Mary Stott (born Shipp).
2 CONT Bryant was born in 1636, in Lancaster, Lancaster, Virginia, United States.
2 CONT Mary was born in 1640, in Lower, Norfolk, Virginia, United States.
2 CONT Mary was baptized on December 26 1630, in Pontefract, York, England.
2 CONT Mary had 4 siblings: Anne Stott, Ann Potts (born Stott), James Andrew Stott and Bryant Stott.
2 CONT Mary married Henri Bascom Pullen, Jr. in 1684, at age 12 in Lancaster, Virginia, United States.
2 CONT Henri was born in 1660, in White Chapel Magisterial District, Lancaster, Colony of Virginia, British Colonial America.
2 CONT They had 5 children: William M Pullen/ Peillen, Frances Blackerby (born Pullen), Thomas Pullen, John Pullen and Bryant Pullen.
2 CONT Mary then married Unknown.
2 CONT They had one son: Thomas Pullen.
2 CONT Mary then married Unknown.
2 CONT They had one son: Bryan Pullen.
2 CONT Mary then married Unknown.
2 CONT They had one son: John Pullen.
2 CONT ---
