1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LCXQ-GBC'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Jane Kemp was born on 1687 in Talbot County, Maryland, United States to Robert Kemp and Elizabeth Webb Kemp.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Jane married Robert Clothier on July 6, 1709 in Bolton, Talbot County, Maryland, United States and had several children:
2 CONT Daughters Susannah, Mary, Elizabeth, Nancy
2 CONT Sons Thomas, Robert Knapp, Lewis, John, 
2 CONT
2 CONT After his death, she remarried Thomas Eubanks on 7/11/1717 in Talbot County, Maryland.
2 CONT They had one daughter, Jane Eubanks.
2 CONT
2 CONT Following Eubanks death (circa 1723) she remarried 3rd husband Tristram Thomas Jr. on 10/15/1725 in Maryland.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''NOTE: SOME NON-SOURCED LISTINGS SHOW A DEATH DATE OF 1723. THIS IS NOT ACCURATE, AND POSSIBLY AN ACCIDENTAL REFERENCE TO SECOND HUSBAND ROBERT EUBANKS.''' Jane is referenced in the will of third husband Tristram Thomas Jr. as J
2 CONC ane Kemp Clothier Eubanks Thomas. Jane is also listed as the executrix of Tristram Thomas Jr,'s will, indicating she is still alive after his death on 2/11/1746. See documentation below.
2 CONT '''
2 CONT DOCUMENTATION OF BIRTH:'''
2 CONT Source Date
2 CONT 1687
2 CONT Web Page (Link to the Record)
