2 CONT State	MD
2 CONT Country	USA
2 CONT
2 CONT '''DOCUMENTATION OF MARRIAGE TO ROBERT EUBANKS, FOLLOWING DEATH OF 1ST HUSBAND ROBERT CLOTHIER (maiden name Kemp, married name Clothier both indicated):'''
2 CONT Source Date
2 CONT 1717
2 CONT Web Page (Link to the Record)
