2 CONT Describe The Record (Notes)
2 CONT Name	Jane Cloather
2 CONT [Jane Clothier]
2 CONT [Jane Kemp]
2 CONT Event Type	Marriage Intention (Marriage)
2 CONT Marriage Date	27 Jun 1717
2 CONT Marriage Date on Image	27 1717
2 CONT Marriage Place	Talbot, Maryland
2 CONT Residence Date	27 Jun 1717
