2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Cicely Sackville''' was the daughter of Robert Sackville, 2nd Earl of Dorset and Margaret Howard.[1]. She was born 1580 in Dorset, England and died March 1676.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cicely married Hon. Sir Henry Compton, son of Sir Henry Compton, 1st Lord Compton, and his wife, Anne Spencer.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Compton II married first Cecily Sackville (his step-sister), daughter of Robert Sackville, 2nd Earl of Dorset, and his first wife Lady Margaret Howard, daughter of Thomas Howard, 4th Duke of Norfolk,[1] and they had 3(?) son
2 CONC s and 3 daughters:[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT # Richard Compton, eldest son, knight;[1]
2 CONT # William Compton;[1]
2 CONT # Cicely Compton;[1], m. 1st Sir John Fermor, 2nd Henry Arundell, 3rd Lord Arundell of Wardour[5]
2 CONT # Anne Compton;[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT GENTLEMAN'S MAGAZINE (1789), p. 112, states that Sir Henry Compton had three daughters: Cicely, Mary, and Margaret, and that Margaret married _____ Sackville.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Compton II married secondly Mary, daughter of Sir George Browne of Battle, Sussex, and they had two sons and four daughters.[4][3]
2 CONT
2 CONT He passed away about 1649.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT ___________
2 CONT *'''Cicely Sackville1
2 CONT *F, #23919
2 CONT *Last Edited=29 Nov 2012
2 CONT *'''     Cicely Sackville was the daughter of Robert Sackville, 2nd Earl of Dorset and Margaret Howard.1,2 She married Hon. Sir Henry Compton, son of Sir Henry Compton, 1st Lord Compton and Anne Spencer.3
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Compton.3
2 CONT *'''Children of Cicely Sackville and Hon. Sir Henry Compton
2 CONT ** 1.Colonel Henry Compton4 d. 13 May 1652
2 CONT ** 2.Cicely Compton+1 b. c 1610, d. 24 Mar 1675/76
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 265. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT * 2.[S37] Volume 3, page 3456. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT * 3.[S37] See. [S37]
2 CONT * 4.[S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume I, page 264.
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p2392.htm#i23919 
2 CONT ________________________
2 CONT *'''Cecily SACKVILLE
2 CONT *Father: Robert SACKVILLE (2° E. Dorset)
2 CONT *Mother: Margaret HOWARD
2 CONT *'''Married: Henry COMPTON
2 CONT *Children: 
2 CONT **1. Henry COMPTON (d. 13 May 1652, in a duel with George Brydges) 
2 CONT **2. Mary COMPTON (m. John Lumley) 
2 CONT **3. Cicely COMPTON (B. Arundell of Wardour) (m.1 Henry Arundel, B. Arundell of Wardour - m.2 John Fermor) 
2 CONT **4. Son COMPTON
2 CONT **5. Dau. COMPTON
2 CONT **6. Son COMPTON
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/SACKVILLE.htm#Cecily SACKVILLE1 
2 CONT ___________________________
