2 CONC Sir+Henry+%22of+Brambletye%22+Compton%22+genealogy&source=bl&ots=h1hxa9o-qC&sig=XcnDJZjhBnVpuveccqSkmVzCzuM&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwiJzPfejYHPAhXGGh4KHe5VBJsQ6AEINTAF#v=onepage&q=%22Sir%20Henry%20%22of%20Brambletye%22%20Compton%22%2
