2 CONT Edward Lewis was born in 1586 in Llystabout, Wales. He died in 1630 in Edington, Wiltshire, England. He married Anne Sackville. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife:  Anne Sackville was born in 1586 in Brecon, Wales. She died on 25 Sep 1664 in Brecon, Wales. She married Edward Lewis. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT # M i Richard Lewis was born in 1623. He died on 7 Oct 1706. 
2 CONT # M ii William Lewis was born in 1609 in Edington, Wiltshire, England. He died in 1661. 
2 CONT # F iii Ann Lewis was born in 1611 in Edington, Wiltshire, England. 
2 CONT # M iv Edward Lewis was born in 1621 in Edington, Wiltshire, England. He died in 1670. 
2 CONT # M v Robert Lewis II was born in 1607 in Brecon, Wales. He died in 1656 in Hanover County, Virginia. 
2 CONT
