2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.thepeerage.com/p17798.htm#i177971
2 CONT Sir Matthew Wentworth, 2nd Bt. M, #177971, Last Edited=28 Dec 2021. Sir Matthew Wentworth, 2nd Bt. was born after 1615. He was the son of George Wentworth and Mary Ashburnham. He married, secondly, Judith Rhodes, daughter of Thoma
2 CONC s Rhodes, before 1663. He married, thirdly, Anne Osbaldeston, daughter of William Osbaldeston and Anne Wentworth, on 18 September 1676 at Hunmanby, Yorkshire, England. He died on 1 August 1678. He gained the title of 2nd Baronet W
2 CONC entworth, of Bretton Hall [E.].
2 CONT Child of Sir Matthew Wentworth, 2nd Bt. and Judith Rhodes:
2 CONT Sir Mathew Wentworth, 3rd Bt.+1 b. a 1663, d. Feb 1705/6
