1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Sir John Pelham, 3rd Bt.1
2 CONT *''''''M, #28844, b. before 1627, d. circa January 1702/3
2 CONT *Last Edited=13 Feb 2011
2 CONT *''''''Sir John Pelham, 3rd Bt. was the son of Sir Thomas Pelham, 2nd Bt. and Mary Wilbraham.2 He married Lady Lucy Sydney, daughter of Robert Sydney, 2nd Earl of Leicester and Lady Dorothy Percy, on 20 January 1647.1 He died circ
2 CONC a January 1702/3.1 He was buried on 20 January 1702/3.1
2 CONT *''''''     Sir John Pelham, 3rd Bt. held the office of Member of Parliament (M.P.) for Hastings from 1645 to 1646.1 He held the office of Member of Parliament (M.P.) for Sussex between 1654 and 1658.1 He succeeded to the title of
2 CONC  3rd Baronet Pelham, of Laughton, co. Sussex [E., 1611] circa August 1654.1 He held the office of Member of Parliament (M.P.) for Sussex between 1660 and 1698.1
2 CONT *''''''Children of Sir John Pelham, 3rd Bt. and Lady Lucy Sydney
