1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John French DID NOT marry a Joanna Gage b. in 1611.  This is a common error.  The will of Jeffery Syday in 1632 makes it clear that Joan is his daughter who is married to John French.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ??? 2 different wives named Joanna? John French DID NOT marry a Joanna Gage b. in 1611. This is a common error. The will of Jeffery Syday in 1632 makes it clear that Joan is his daughter who is married to John French: 
