1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas More V was born at Leyton in 1607. Married Mary Brooke in June 1629. Mary was the daughter of Sir Basil Brooke of Madeley Court, Madeley, Shropshire and his wife Etheldreda Brudenell.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas More V died at Goodman‟s Fields, Whitechapel on 12th January 1660. Where he is buried is not known. Mary, then living in London, was buried at St. Mary‟s Church, North Mymms, Hertfordshire on 18th June 1683.
2 CONT
