1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sir John Hungerford, of Downe Ampney. Will dated Au 26, 1633, proved May 2 1635. Wife Lady Ann H. Daughter Sackville, daughter Platt. Sister Lady Lucy, son John, son Dunch, grandchild Bridget Dunch. My 4 daughters;
2 CONC  Bridget, Lady Lisley, Elisabeth Lady Richard, Barbara, Lady Sackville & Marie, wife of William Platt, Esq. Brother's in law Edward Goddard Esq, of Woothey & Richard Barkley, of Rencombe, Esq to be assistants to my executors. My w
2 CONC ife, Richard Arnold my wife's son.
2 CONT
2 CONT FROM THE WEBSITE:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.southfrm.demon.co.uk/Murder/JohnL.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Lisle, John 1610?-1664, regicide, born about 1610, was second son of Sir William Lisle of Wootton, Isle of Wight, by Bridget, daughter of Sir John Hungerford of Down Ampney, Gloucestershire (BERRY, County Genealogies, ‘Hampshire,'
2 CONC  p. 174).
2 CONT
2 CONT Bridget HUNGERFORD
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 1580, Down Ampney, Gloucester, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: John HUNGERFORD (Sir Knight)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Mary BERKELEY
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: William LISLE (b. 1569) (son of Anthony Lisle and Elizabeth Dormer) (m.2 Elizabeth Searle - m.3 Grace Potnall) Ellingham, Isle of Wright, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. John LISLE (b. 1600)
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. William LISLE
2 CONT
