2 CONC 954a, 955a; LJ, v. 543a; Waylen, 187; VCH Wilts. v. 138, 139; Wilts. Arch. Mag. xxvi. 343; Som. Arch. and Nat. Hist. Soc. Procs. xxiv. 62; HMC Bath, iv. 279. 43. Hoare, Wilts. i. 16; Collinson, Som. i. 146. 44. Som. Arch. and Nat.
