1 NAME Thomas /Windham (Wyndham)/
2 GIVN Thomas
2 _MARNM Windham (Wyndham)
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BET 1596 AND 1598
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stokesby
3 CTRY England
