1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=flager&id=I91205  
2 CONT
2 CONT # Name: Thomas Plunkett 1 2
2 CONT # Sex: M
2 CONT # Reference Number: 4984.0
2 CONT # Birth: BET 1607 AND 1623 in Rathmore & Girley, County Meath, Ireland 3
2 CONT # ALIA: Lord Plunkett
2 CONT # Note: Thomas is styled as the original 'Plunkett' immigrant. It is reported that he traveled from London to Virginia via Barbados in 1635 (2 May 1635), aboard the ship 'Alexander' under Captain Burche. Also aboard this same ship
2 CONC  were Edward (listed as 20), Thomas (listed as 28 ?) and Rowland (listed as age 18) Plunkett. Another source indicates that he did not arrive in Virginia until as late as 8 July 1651. On souce indicates he may have died as early a
2 CONC s 1653. One souce indicates that Thomas did not arrived in Virginia until 1654. and another indicates that he was resident in Caroline County, Virginia as late as 1670. These conflicts need additional verification and research.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Alexander Plunkett b: ABT 1590 Mother: Genet Preston
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 ? Plunkett
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Has Children Thomas 'Alexander' Plunkett b: BET 1640 AND 1653 in Rathmore, Ireland or England
