1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT '''Name	Robert Kemp'''
2 CONT Birth Date	1665
2 CONT Death Date	18 Dec 1734
2 CONT Event Type	Burial
2 CONT Event Place	Gissing, South Norfolk District, Norfolk, England
