2 CONT === Life Sketch ===
2 CONT James SAMPSON (RIN: 03651) was born 1625 in Stevenheath,,Middlesex,England. He married Elizabeth BARCROFT 03 December 1666 in Stepney,Stevenheath,Middlesex,England. He died 04 February 1689 in Isle Wight,,Virginia,USA. Elizabeth B
2 CONC ARCROFT (RIN: 00315), daughter of Charles BEARCROFT and Dorothy CROSBY , was born 1630 in Isle of Wight County, Virginia. She died 1670 in Isle of Wight County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of James SAMPSON and Elizabeth BARCROFT are:  1. Sarah SAMPSON (RIN: 03652), b. 1651 [Sic: not their daughter]
2 CONT
