1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Greeley-101
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mary Greeley''', daughter of Andrew Greele and Mary Moyce, was born at Salisbury, Massachusetts on July 16, 1649.[1][2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Ephraim Winsley there on Jan 26, 1668[3] and they had at least eight children. [2] She died on August 11, 1697.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT # Mary b 1669
2 CONT # Samuel b Oct 21, 1670
2 CONT # Elizabeth b Feb 16, 1673/4; died 1742
2 CONT # Martha b Mar 21, 1676/7; died 1677
2 CONT # Ephraim b Mar 19, 1677/8; died Nov 27, 1709
2 CONT # Martha b Nov 4, 1684/5; died Aug 22, 1697
2 CONT # Hannah b Mar 23, 1688/9; married Andrew Greeley
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
