2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin was born October 9, 1654 in Salisbury, Massachusetts.[1] He married Elizabeth Smith at Haverill in January of 1681.[2] They had at least three children before he died there December 4, 1690; Mary was born posthumously.[3]
