2 CONT He married Nov. 26. 1667, Phebe, daughter of Robert Lay of Saybrook, Ct., who died in 1699, age 49 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 142.
2 CONT
2 CONT Phebe Lay, daughter of Robert and Sarah (Fenner) Lay, was born in Saybrook, CT, Jan 5, 1650, and died in Stonington, CT, in 1699 as the widow of John B. Denison, whom she married Nov. 26, 1667.
