2 CONT Brief Life History of Freelove
2 CONT
2 CONT When Freelove Fenner was born in 1656, in Providence, Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, her father, Arthur Fenner, was 37 and her mother, Mehitable Waterman, was 30. She married Gideon Crawford on 13 April 1687, 
2 CONC in Providence, Providence, Rhode Island, United States. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 2 daughters. She died on 1 June 1712, in her hometown, at the age of 56, and was buried in North Burial Ground, Providence, Provi
2 CONC dence, Rhode Island, United States.
