1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Greenfield Larrabee''' was born on April 20, 1648 in Old Saybrook Colony. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-32440717 Greenfield Larrabee, I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34703245312 Phebe Larabee]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Greenfield married [https://www.geni.com/profile-18035941 Alice Larrabee] on March 16, 1672. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-37225375 Thomas Larribee]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-32595006 John Larrabee]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-22772545 Phebe Randall]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-43606456 Alice Parke (Larrabee)]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-18042491 Dorothy Safford]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-37225893 Elizabeth Larrabee]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-37225892 Nathaniel Larribee].
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on February 3, 1739, in Norwich, New London County, Connecticut Colony. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He did not have a daughter [https://www.geni.com/profile-66800730 Rebecca (Larriford) Stearns]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
