1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Sacco Valley Settlements
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. John,2 second son of Greenfield, 1st, b. Feb. 23, 1649; removed to Windham, Conn., from Norwich with a family. In 1691, he had broken land, built a house, and established himself upon a tract granted him on condition that he bu
2 CONC ild upon it and run the ferry for seven years. He was admitted and enrolled as one of the inhabitants of Windham, May 30, 1693.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
