1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Elizabeth Larrabee==
2 CONT * Birth:	Jan 23 1652 - Saybrook, Middlesex, Connecticut
2 CONT * Death:	Dec 4 1727 - New London, New London, Connecticut
2 CONT * Parents: Greenfield Larrabee, Phoebe Brown 
2 CONT * Married: Joshua Hempstead, John Edgecombe
2 CONT * Children:	Elizabeth Hempstead, Mary Hempstead, Lydia Hempstead, Joshua Hempstead, Hannah Hempstead, Phebe Hempstead, Patience Hempstead, Lucy Hempstead
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT From [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=60465583&ref=wvr Find A Grave Memorial# 60465583]
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was the daughter of Greenfield Larrabee and Phoebe Brown. She married Joshua Hempstead about 1669, and after his death married John Edgecombe.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her son Joshua writes upon her death, 4 Dec 1727: "Mother was taken violently with ye same pain in her Breast as She had Thursday night was Sevennight and She died Sudently with it In less yn a quarter of an hour. Born in April 16
2 CONC 52 aged 75 3/4 almost. I only had Abigail & Eliza Edgcumbe with her about 5 Clock in ye morning."
2 CONT
2 CONT The following day Joshua writes: "aftern at home. wee buried mother att Sunset." 
2 CONT --------------------
