1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT From [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=101996019 Find A Grave Memorial# 101996019]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was born 17 November 1654 in Providence, Rhode Island to Pardon Elisha Tillinghast and Sarah Butterworth. She died around 1694. In 1670 she probably married Joseph Harrington. It has been noted that Pardon Tillinghast and hi
2 CONC s first wife Sarah Butterworth had a daughter named Sarah born 17 November 1654. She is mentioned as having "died" in 1671, but this is now interpreted to mean that she married and there is no further record under the name Tilling
2 CONC hast. She died before her father and, therefore, is not mentioned in his will.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Tillinghast-93
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/101996019
