1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =John Tillinghast=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1 Jul 1657 Newport, Newport County, Rhode Island, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 16 Dec 1690 (aged 33) Newport, Newport County, Rhode Island, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Common Burying Ground, Newport, Newport County, Rhode Island, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 21493104
2 CONT
2 CONT John Tillinghast was born in September of 1657. He may have been buried in his father's lot in the center of Rhode Island, the only lot not moved when the town expanded, or be buried in Newport.[2,3]   His mother Sarah died when J
2 CONC ohn was small child; he was raised by his stepmother: Liddea Masters Tabor [1648-1720]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Pardon Tillinghast 1622–1718
2 CONT Sarah Butterworth Tillinghast 1623–1661
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Isabel Sayles Hicks 1659–1735
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Sarah Tillinghast Harrington 1654–1694
2 CONT Mary Tillinghast Carpenter 1661–1711
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Half Siblings'''
