2 CONT Phillip Tillinghast 1669–1732
2 CONT Benjamin Tillinghast 1672–1726
2 CONT Abigail Tillinghast Sheldon 1673–1744
2 CONT Joseph Tillinghast 1677–1763
2 CONT Mercy Tillinghast Power 1680–1769
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
