2 CONT This biography is a rough draft. It was auto-generated by a GEDCOM import and needs to be edited.
2 CONT
2 CONT There are two (2) Abigail Tillinghasts. One, born 1673-74 who married Nicholas Sheldon. The other Abigail Tillinghast (1763-1826) married Clark Rathbun (1760-1815) and they moved from Rhode Island to Ohio. The parents of the secon
2 CONC d Abigail were Thomas Tillinghast and Mary Thomas. Please be sure to check which generation and which Abigail Tillinghast you are researching.
