2 CONT Brief Life History of Abigail
2 CONT
2 CONT When Abigail Tillinghast was born in March 1674, in Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, her father, Rev. Pardon Tillinghast, was 49 and her mother, Lydia Taber, was 25. She married Nicholas Sheldon Sr in 1691, in P
2 CONC rovidence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 23 November 1744, in Providence, Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, at the age of 70, and wa
2 CONC s buried in Swan Point Cemetery, Providence, Providence, Rhode Island, United States.
