1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joseph Tillinghast was born on 11 AUG 1677. He died on 1 DEC 1763. He was buried in Newport, Cemetery. JOSEPH MARRIED FREELOVE STAFFORD. 
2 CONT
2 CONT FATHER WAS PARDON TILLINGHAST 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph was a Six Principle Baptist. Many Baptists then were jailed for refusing to pay support to the established Massachusetts Bay Colony Puratin Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT After Freelove's death, Joseph married Mary Paris Hendren.
2 CONT
2 CONT JOSEPH ALSO MARRIED MARY HENDRON.(S11 P418)
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Freelove Stafford. Children were: Lydia Tillinghast, Joseph Tillinghast, Freelove Tillinghast, Anna Tillinghast, Samuel Tillinghast.
