1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Elizabeth Tillinghast Taber
2 CONT * BIRTH	1685 - Providence, Providence County, Rhode Island, USA 
2 CONT * DEATH	1750 - New London, New London County, Connecticut, USA 
2 CONT * BURIAL	Burial Details Unknown 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The exact dates of birth and death could not be found, nor could the place of burial. Elizabeth was born about 1685 and died about 1750.
2 CONT
2 CONT *****
2 CONT E-mail regarding Find-A-Grave from Brett Burrowes 2-3-2020 which was helpful in sorting out the various Philip Tabers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Taber (149170972)
2 CONT
2 CONT Suggested edit: The Philip Taber of New London CT is often confused with his cousins of the same name, and who lived about the same time. This Philip was the son of Joseph Taber, who moved from Dartmouth, MA to New London, CT. He 
2 CONC married Elizabeth Tillinghast and was born about 1682 and died on 27 Nov 1750 per the gravestone. It was Philip the son of Thomas Taber who married Susannah Tucker. Philip son of Thomas was born 7 Dec 1689 and died in Dartmouth, M
2 CONC A after Jun 1749. Finally, there is Philip the son of Philip Taber, who was born 29 Feb 1675 in Dartmouth, and died 5 Nov 1751 in Bristol County, MA.
2 CONT Contributor: Brett (46887842) • bburrowes@aol.com
2 CONT
2 CONT *****
2 CONT
