1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Edward HAZEN was born on 12 Dec 1614 in Cadney, Lincolnshire, ENGLAND. He was christened on 14 Dec 1614 in Cadney, Lincolnshire, ENGLAND. He emigrated in 1649 from the emigrant ancestor. He immigrated in 1650 to Ro
2 CONC wley, MA. He was buried in Jul 1683. He died on 22 Jul 1683 in Rowley, Essex, Massachusetts. He BAPL Submitted. He ENDL Submitted. He SLGC Submitted. He has reference number 9311. Parents: Thomas HASSEN and Elizabeth .
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Elizabeth WFT Est 1631-1663.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Hannah GRANT in Mar 1649/50. Children were: Elizabeth HAZEN, Hannah HAZEN, John HAZEN, Thomas HAZEN, Edward HAZEN, Isabel HAZEN, Priscilla HAZEN, Edna HAZEN, Richard HAZEN, Hephzibah HAZEN, Sarah HAZEN
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT http://nielsenhayden.com/genealogy-tng/getperson.php?personID=I23299&tree=nh1
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (1) Elizabeth --- Bef. September 1649.  He married (2) Hannah Grant March 1650 in Rowley, Esses Co., MA.
2 CONT
