2 CONT 6 March 1648–19 September 1718
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Elizabeth
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elizabeth Payne was born on 6 March 1648, in Dedham, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Thomas Paine, was 36 and her mother, Rebecca Ware, was 28. She married John Randolph Hunting II on 
2 CONC 10 April 1671, in Dedham, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 3 daughters. She died on 19 September 1718, in her hometown, at the age of 70, and was buried in D
2 CONC edham, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
