2 CONT
2 CONT EDWARD WADE III was born 1660 in Virginia and died in James City Co Virginia. He married ELIZABETH PASQUE by 1688. She was born 1660 and died 28 Jun 1696 Charles Parish York Co Virginia. She was the daughter of PETER PASQUE & ?.
2 CONT
