2 CONT ===Andrew Wade Sr. (abt. 1670 - 1740)
2 CONT * Born about 1670 in Virginia
2 CONT * Died 1740 in Hanover, Virginia
2 CONT * Son of Edward Wade II and Mary Catherine (Hampton) Wade
2 CONT * Brother of Edward Wade III, James Wade [half] and James Wade Sr
2 CONT * Husband of Elizabeth (Dawson) Wade — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT * Father of John Wade, Joseph Wade, Sarah Wade, Richard Wade I and George Wade
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT -1 JOHN WADE b c 1690.
2 CONT -2 JOSEPH WADE b Abt. 1690, James City Co VA d 1757 Orange Co VA (This part of the pedigree has been kept separte because it seems that either there were two different Josephs or that this Joseph had a second wife, Sarah Willis, b
2 CONC y whom at least Mary Willis Wade is likely to have been the daughter of Joseph. All sites so far including Joseph also show his daughter, Sarah, as having married a Fontaine, the author's line of descent, as well as the number of 
2 CONC siblings and the names of their spouses, but there are different opinions on where Joseph fits into this pedigree and who his wife was.) m Sarah Lide/Lied b 1693 in Va d 1765 dau of Robert Lide/Lied
2 CONT -3 JAMES J WADE b Abt. 1700 m Dorothy x b 1710
2 CONT -4 ROBERT WADE SR b 20 Nov 1700 James City Co VA d Bef. 19 Apr 1770, Anheim Parish, Halifax Co VA will proved m 1722 Elizabeth Hampton b about 1700 Va d Anheim Parish Halifax Co Va
2 CONT -5 RICHARD WADE SR b Abt. 1704 d 15 Nov 1757 Tuckahoe Creek Plantation, Goochland Co VA m1 Elizabeth Elgar m2 Abt. 1723 in probably Henrico Co GISSELL DABNEY Va d 15 Mar 1768 in Tuckahoe Creek Plantation, Goochland, Virginia. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
