2 CONT Source: Halifax County Virginia Will Book O (1752 to 1773), Compiled by Marian Dodson Chiarito, Published December 1982, Repository: Family History Library; Salt Lake City, Utah, Call No. 975.5661P2cm (Vol. 1), p. 32
