2 CONT Halifax, Virginia, British Colonial America
2 CONT Testator: Andrew Wade (the elder)
2 CONT Will date: January 14, 1766
2 CONT Will Probated: July 17, 1766
2 CONT To my grandson Benjamin Wade, son of John Wade
2 CONT To my son, Henry Wade
2 CONT To my son, Benjamin Wade
2 CONT To my granddaughter Isbell Wade, daughter of Benjamin Wade
2 CONT To my son, Andrew Wade
2 CONT To my son, Joseph
2 CONT To my son William Wade my tract of land on Bleu Stone which I purchased of my son in law William Robinson (245 acres)
2 CONT To my son, William Wade....named property...if he married Miss Dorothy Brookes
2 CONT To my son in law, William Robinson fifty pounds current money
2 CONT Executors: John Wade and son in law, William Robinson
2 CONT
