1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2386.htm#i71701
2 CONT *''''''Frances Waldegrave
2 CONT *F, b. circa 1580, d. March 1645
2 CONT *Father Sir Nicholas Waldegrave b. c 1557, d. 19 Jun 1621 
2 CONT *Mother Catherine Brown b. c 1558 
2 CONT *''''''     Frances Waldegrave was born circa 1580 at England. She married Sir Richard Weston circa 1602. Frances Waldegrave died in March 1645 at England.
2 CONT *''''''Family Sir Richard Weston b. Feb 1577 
2 CONT *Child 
2 CONT *◦Catherine Weston+ b. c 1605, d. 31 Oct 1645
2 CONT *_________________ 
2 CONT *http://www.thepeerage.com/p41236.htm#i412356
2 CONT *''''''Frances Waldegrave1
2 CONT *F, #412356
2 CONT *Last Edited=31 Dec 2009
2 CONT *''''''     Frances Waldegrave is the daughter of Nicholas Waldegrave and Catherine Browne.1 She married Richard Weston, 1st Earl of Portland, son of Sir Jerome Weston and Mary Cave, before 1605.1
2 CONT *''''''     From before 1605, her married name became Weston.1
2 CONT *''''''Child of Frances Waldegrave and Richard Weston, 1st Earl of Portland
2 CONT **1.Jerome Weston, 2nd Earl of Portland1 b. 16 Dec 1605, d. 17 Mar 1663
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extin
2 CONC ct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume X, page 584. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *______________________
