1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 2. Isaac LEARNED baptized: 25-Feb-1623, Bermondsey parish, Co. Surry, England, m. 9-Jul-1646, in Woburn, MA, Mary STERNES, b. England, d. 8-Jan-1663. Isaac died 27-Nov-1657, Chelmsford, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT *Mary LEARNED b. 7-Aug-1647, Woburn, MA, m. 1673, Moses BARRON, b. 1-Mar-1643, Chelmsford, MA.
2 CONT *Hannah LEARNED b. 24-Aug-1649, Woburn, MA, m. 25-Dec-1666, Joseph FARWELL, b. 20-Feb-1641, Chelmsford, MA.
2 CONT *William LEARNED b. 1-Oct-1650, Woburn, MA, d. 1684, Watertown, MA.
2 CONT *Sarah LEARNED b. 18-Oct-1653, Chelmsford, MA, m. Jonathan BARRETT, b. Chelmsford, MA. Sarah died 11-Jan-1695.
2 CONT *Isaac LEARNED b. 16-Sep-1655, Chelmsford, MA, m. 23-Jul-1679, Sarah BIGELOW, b. 29-Sep-1659. Isaac died 15-Sep-1737.
2 CONT *Benoni LEARNED b. 19-Nov-1657.
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://castlescribe.usanethosting.com/fam/learned.html
2 CONT *http://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Learned/6000000000640404602
2 CONT
2 CONT MARY, eldest known child of Isaac & Mary (Barker) Stearns, was baptized at Nayland with Wissington, 6 January 1625/6. She married at Woburn 9 July 1646 Isaac Learned, son of WILLIAM LEARNED. Source: Anderson's Great Migration Begi
2 CONC ns.
