1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Parents: Isaac & Mary (Barker) Stearns
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah baptised: 5 October 1628 Nayland, Soffolk Co. England
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah buried: 17 June 1656 Watertown, New England
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah married:  Henry Freeman 25 December 1650 Watertown, New England
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 child
2 CONT
2 CONT Watertown Records: Book I, pgs: 28, 38 & 72: Book II, pg: 21
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT  The Record says she m. Samuel Freeman  in Watertown Dec 25, 1650, but there is good reason to believe that it is an error.
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried- June 17, 1656 ANNA (HANNAH), 2nd known child of Isaac & Mary (Barker) Stearns, was baptized at Nayland with Wissington, 5 October 1628; m. Watertown 25 December 1650 Henry Freeman, son of SAMUEL FREEMAN. Source: Anderson's
2 CONC  Great Migration Begins.
