1 NOTE {geni:about_me} HISTORY OF THE TOWN OF STONINGTON, County of New London, Connecticut, from its first settlement in 1649 to 1900, by Richard Anson Wheeler, New London, CT, 1900, p. 457
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Birth:  1640 Watertown Middlesex County Massachusetts, USA Death:  Jun. 24, 1671 Billerica Middlesex County Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizaeth Stearns was born in 1640, in Watertown, Middlesex County, Massachusetts. She was the daughter of Isaac Stearns and Mary Barker. On April 13, 1664, she married Samuel Manning, in Watertown, and they had two children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Samuel Manning, born 1665, in Billerica, Massachusetts, died February 20, 1755  2) John Manning, born August 30, 1666, in Billerica, Mass.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Stearns Manning died on June 24, 1671, in Watertown, Middlesex County, Massachusetts. Elizaeth Stearns was born in 1640, in Watertown, Middlesex County, Massachusetts.  She was the daughter of Isaac Stearns and Mary Bark
2 CONC er.  On April 13, 1664, she married Samuel Manning, in Watertown, and they had two children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Samuel Manning, born 1665, in Billerica, Massachusetts, died February 20, 1755  2) John Manning, born August 30, 1666, in Billerica, Mass.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Stearns Manning died on June 24, 1671, in Watertown, Middlesex County, Massachusetts.
2 CONT *****************************************************
