2 CONT ===Mary Skillings formerly Pride===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 30 Apr 1716 in Gloucester, Essex, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Joseph Pride and Elizabeth (Bond) Pride
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Jane (Pride) Burnham, Amy (Pride) Larrabee and Sarah (Pride) Stevens [half]
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Benjamin Skillings — married 16 Mar 1739 in Falmouth, Maine
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Deliverance (Skillings) Irish, Isaac Skillings, Thomas Skillings and Abigail (Skillings) Whitney
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 1757 at about age 40 in Portland, Cumberland, Maine
