2 CONT *Sir John Bamfield, 3 son, M.P. for Penryn, created a Baraonet 14 July 1641, named in will of son John, d. Ap. 1650, aet. 60, bur. at Poltimore. M.I. = Gertrude, 4 da. of Amias Coplestone and coheir to her brother John Coplestone 
2 CONC of Warleigh, mar. 3 May 1637. Will 8 Nov. 1657, pro. 29 Mar. 1658, P.C.C. (Wootton 638). Named in will of her son John as deceased 1664. ch: Elizabeth, 1 da., mar. to Thomas Moore of Haychurch, co. Devon, who is mentioned in his m
2 CONC other-in-law's will. ; '''Gertrude, 2 da., mar. to Sir William Morrice of Werrington, Kt., named in her mother's will.''' ; Grace, 3 da., named in her mother's will, living 1657, mar. to Wir William Bastard of Gerston, Kt. ; Susan
2 CONC na, 4 da., named in her mother's will, living 1657, mar. John Giffard of Brightly. ; Frances, 5 dau., named in her mother's will, living 1657, extrix. of will of her brother John, mar. Sir John Elwill of Exeter. ; Dorothy, 6 da., 
2 CONC named in her mother's will, living 1657, a minor, mar. Sir Francis Drake of Buckland, Bart. ; Richard Bampfield, 5 son, named in his mother's will and will of his brother John, living 1664. ; Lewis m. Elizabeth Hull ; Amias m. Ara
2 CONC bella Wyndham ; John Bampfield, 2 son, named in his mother's will, living 1657, d. s.p. Will 9 May, pro. 22 Aug. 1664, Archd. Ct. Exeter. ; Sir Coplestone m. Margaret Bulkeley & Jane Pole
2 CONT **Lewis Bampfield, 4 son, named in his mother's will, living 1657. = Elizabeth da. of ... Hull of Torpiddle, co. Dorset. ch: John ; Edmund ; Elizabeth ; Anne.
2 CONT **Amias Bamfield, 3 son, named in the wills of his mother and brother Sir Coplestone, living 1691. = Arabella, da. of Sir Hugh Wydham of Kentsford, co. Somerset. ch: Gertrude ; Mary.
2 CONT **SIR COPLESTONE Bampfield of Poltimore, eldest son and heir, 2 Bart., named in will of his bro. John, Sheriff of Devon 14 Chas. II, executor of his mother's will, d. 1691. Will 24 Aug. 1691. Admon. with will attached granted 2 Ma
2 CONC y 1692 to Mary Bampfield, mother of the exr. during his minority. Prin. Reg. Exeter. = Margaret, da. of Frances Bulkeley of Burgate, co. Hants, 1 wife, named in the will of hier mother-in-law Dame Gertrude Bampfield, living 1657, 
2 CONC and as deceased in her husband's will. ch: John Coplestone Bulkeley Bampfield, ob. s.p. ; Hugh m. Mary Clifford ; Margaret, died an infant.
2 CONT ** etc.
