2 CONT http://king.genealogy.googlepages.com/%22thekingfamily%22bygoodekingfeldhausergeorgem.g.stafford
2 CONT
2 CONT Captain William King, son of Robert King and Hannah Scarborough, was the first of the name whom we find in the records of Stafford County, Va., as settling there permanently. He married Martha Richardson of Middlesex County, Va. H
2 CONC e was a captain of militia in that county. After her death he married Judith Peyton, daughter of Valentine Peyton and Frances Gerrard. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
