2 CONC  Temperance Bailey - though i think we go back to her - and thus Cecily Jordan Farrar (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cecily_Jordan_Farrar#Relationship_to_Temperance_Baley) through another line...) Walter Aston - https://en.wikiped
