2 CONT Henrico Co., VA, St. John's Parish (1611-1884),p. 189, LDS #0962838. Henrico
2 CONT Will Book, Vol.I, p.183
2 CONT Inventory of Mr. John Cocke appraised 27 Oct. 1699 by court order of 2 Oct.
2 CONT 1699, by Thomas Edwards,... Value L 102/15/00 presented in court by Obedience,
2 CONT relict and executrix of John Cocke, Recorded 1 Aug. 1700.
2 CONT Adventurers of Purse and Person 1607-1625, 3rd ed. 1987 revised and edited by
2 CONT Virginia m. Meyer and John Frederick Dorman, p. 97 says that their marriage in
2 CONT 1696 is recorded in Henrico Deeds and Wills Bk 1688-1697 page 710 and John's
2 CONT death probated in 1699 in Henrico Order Book 1694-1701 page 237.
1 NOTE !SOURCES: Blankenship,  pages 297-317; Combs, pages 1-26; Forsythe;  Walter
2 CONT The Turpin note book in VA Genealogist 31(1987): 5 mentions only daughter,
2 CONT Martha  and son, John as being from this marriage:
2 CONT     LDS FHC microfilm 1035535 item 2 ;
2 CONT Henrico Co Deeds 1688-1697 page 670 1 Oct 1696 recorded 1 Dec 1696: John Cocke
2 CONT Jr. son of Richard Cocke has taken to wife Obedience Branch eldest dtr of my
2 CONT son John Branch, late of Kingsland in same Co I (Jane Gower) give to said John
2 CONT Cocke...plantation where my son John dwelt now in Tenure of Robert Grigg S.
2 CONT Side James River 100 acres bounded by Thomas Branch and Mr. Abell Gower,
2 CONT orphan;
2 CONT     Henrico co VA Wills and Deeds 1697-1704 page 183, not recorded until
2 CONT     1 Aug 1700 but since it refers to october it could only be the previous
2 CONT     Oct of 1699;
2 CONT APPARENTLY CONFLICTS WITH page 162 Henrico Co Wills, Deeds etc 1697-1704
2 CONT      page 162 where same John Cocke husband of Obedience signed a release
2 CONT      recorded 1 Jun 1700, but next release was her sister Priscilla's release
2 CONT      dated in 1699 recorded also 1 Jun 1700--so we are forced to go with the
2 CONT      estate inventory order of 2  Oct 1699 saying John Cocke was already dead;
2 CONT    5 JaN 1729/30 ARTHUR MOSELEY WITNESSED the sale of MALBORNE    HILLS land
2 CONT from Brassure Cocke to James Powell Cocke.
2 CONT    Stutesman adds that this land is north of the James River; SURNAME
2 CONT publication:
2 CONT    Cocke Family notes by James C Southall from William and Mary Qtrly
2 CONT    [copy found in Kittitas Co Gen Soc Ellensburg, WA]; pages 93-265 --pages
2 CONT    numbers may be from the reprint book; pages 11, 185, 250, 253, 256, 263,
2 CONT    264 I marked as particularly relevant; 784 to 806 give speculations on
2 CONT really    ancient ancestry; page 264 gives as original ref Wm and Mary Qtrly
2 CONT XXV,    109-110; on page 256 it gives original refs as Wm and Mary C Qtrly
2 CONT XXV:63,    108-110, same wm Mary 2nd series 13:151,  Va Mag Hist & Biog
2 CONT 37:230; RESEARCHER:
2 CONT     Robert C. Hancock "Bob" Jan 1997 Meade Dr Rt 3 box 32 Castlewood VA 24224
2 CONT descendant of Edward moseley of Charlotte Co's brother John by
2 CONT      Benj and Benj Jr. asked about both of Martha Cocke's grandmother's
2 CONT      maiden names and had two ideas I hadn't heard about the Branch one;
