1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==concerns==
2 CONT '''Although this Mary resembles https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Mcgrew/6000000034196039602 (shown here as a sister), it seems that they are not supposed to be the same person.  Stirnet's ''Moore02'' page does not mention a marria
2 CONC ge between this Mary and a William McGrew; furthermore, it appears that the marriage of this Mary and her 1st shown husband William was at least partially concurrent with the marriage of https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Mcgrew/600
2 CONC 0000034196039602 and https://www.geni.com/people/William-McGrew/6000000000177088463; the marriage of this Mary and her 2nd shown husband John might also have been partially concurrent with the marriage of https://www.geni.com/peop
2 CONC le/Mary-Mcgrew/6000000034196039602 and https://www.geni.com/people/William-McGrew/6000000000177088463.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==brief biography==
2 CONT Countess Consort of Dalhousie
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Bellenden Consort
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be March 17, 1726 at an unspecified location.
2 CONT
