2 CONT **Manners genealogy(Link out of Date)
2 CONT **[1] (New link requires registration/payment)
2 CONT **Leigh Rayment's Peerage Pages [self-published source?][better source needed]
2 CONT *From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Manners,_2nd_Duke_of_Rutland
2 CONT *________________
