2 CONT *   After the death of Lord Stourton, Lady Stourton married Sir Edward Moore of Odiham, Co. Hants., and of Worth, Co. Sussex, Knight, by whom she was mother of Frances Moore, who married William, 11th Lord Stourton. 
2 CONT *   John, 9th Lord Stourton, having died without issue, the Peerage and estates devolved upon his next brother Edward. 
