2 CONT *   Edward, son and heir-apparent of Lord Stourton, having died in the lifetime of his father, '''William, only son and heir of Edward Stourton and grandson and heir of William, eleventh Lord Stourton, consequently succeeded as tw
2 CONC elfth Lord Stourton upon the death of his grandfather, April the 25th, 1672. 
