2 CONC rd Stourton and Elizabeth." The entry in the registers is interlined in another handwriting. He married, in November, 1699, Catherine, eldest daughter and co-heir of Richard Frampton, Esquire, of Bitson, Co. Dorset (who was born i
2 CONC n 1630), by Jane his wife (who died in 1711), daughter of Sir Francis Cottington, of Fonthill, Co. Wilts. .... etc.
