2 CONT Female
2 CONT 13 August 1637–7 March 1694
2 CONT •
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Dorothy
2 CONT
2 CONT When Dorothy Alston was born on 13 August 1637, in Odell, Bedfordshire, England, United Kingdom, her father, Sir John Alston I, was 23 and her mother, Dorothy Lee Temple, was 21. She married Henry Pike before 1664, in Wiltshire, E
2 CONC ngland. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 2 daughters. She died on 7 March 1694, in Woodbridge Township, Middlesex, New Jersey, British Colonial America, at the age of 56, and was buried in Wiltshire, England.
2 CONT
