2 CONT Thomas Earle (1662 - 1727)
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Earle
2 CONT Born 1662 in Warwick, Rhode Islandmap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Son of William Earle and Mary (Walker) Earle
2 CONT Brother of Mary (Earle) Borden, William Earle, Ralph Earle, Caleb Earle, John Earle [half] and Prudence (Earle) Durfee [half]
2 CONT Husband of Mary (Taber) Earle — married 1693 [location unknown]
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of Mary (Earle) Baker, William Earle, Lydia Earle, Rebecca Earle, Sarah Earle, Thomas Earle and Oliver Earle
2 CONT Died 28 Apr 1727 at about age 65 in Warwick, Providence, Rhode Islandmap
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile manager: Sally Lyon private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 13 Jan 2023 | Created 21 Nov 2012
2 CONT This page has been accessed 769 times.
2 CONT
2 CONT This profile is part of the Erleigh Name Study.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas was born in 1662.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Mary Taber, daughter of Philip and Mary Taber, by 1693.[2] Thomas signed with his wife Mary for receipt of their portion of the estate of her father.[3][4]
2 CONT
2 CONT His will is dated 27 April 1727[5] and proved on 19 May 1727 in Warwick, Rhode Island.[6]
2 CONT
2 CONT His date of death, 28 April 1727 is recorded in the heading of his inventory which was taken on 12 May 1727.[6]
2 CONT
