1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary  Wood
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birth:	Circa 1664
2 CONT * Death:	Jan 15 1720/21 - NEWPORT, R.I.
2 CONT * Parents:	William Wood, Martha Earle
2 CONT * Husband:	Samual Wilcox
2 CONT * Husband:	Thomas Mallet
2 CONT * Husband:	John Sanford
2 CONT * Children:	Jerimiah Wilcox, William Wilcox, Mary Brooks (born Wilcox)
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of William Wood and Martha Earle. She m/1 Samuel Wilcox 1682. m/2 ____ Mallets and m/3 John Sanford 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her second husband was Thomas Mallett and her third husband was John Sanford. Named in father's will as Mr. Mallet's wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT In Oct. 1723, Jeremiah Wilcox, only son of Mary Sanford, deceased, late wife of John Sanford of Newport butcher, and Capt. Thomas Brooks, whose deceased wife Mary (formerly Mary Wilcox) as the only daughter of said Mary Sanford, p
2 CONC etitioned the Town Council for a settlement of said Mary Sanford's estate.
2 CONT
