2 CONT Brief Life History of Mary
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Wood was born in 1665, in Portsmouth, Newport, Rhode Island, British Colonial America as the daughter of William Wood and Martha Earle. She married Samuel Wilcox in 1680. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 1 daughte
2 CONC r. She died on 15 December 1721, in Newport, Newport, Rhode Island, United States, at the age of 56, and was buried in Newport, Newport, Rhode Island, British Colonial America.
