1 FAMS @F6000000221070293860@
1 RFN geni:6000000221070293856
1 SUBM @S6000000031247805905@
1 CHAN
2 DATE 31 AUG 2026
3 TIME 05:04:10
0 @I6000000011197270619@ INDI
1 NAME Anne /Bagnell (or Bagenal)/
2 GIVN Anne
