1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT <strong>Sir William Dudley, Baronet [1660]</strong>, of Clapton aforesaid, only s. and h., b. there 2 March 1696; suc. to the Baronetcy, 13 April 1721. He m. 12 Dec. 1719, in London, Elizabeth, da. and h. of Sir Richard Kennedy, 4
2 CONC th Baronet [I. 1660], of Mount Kennedy, co. Wicklow, by Katharine, da. of Sir Francis Blake. Her will dat. 9 July 1747, pr. 9 Feb. 1749/50. He d. s.p.s., at York, 15 June 1764, aged 68, when the Baronetcy became extinct. Will pr. 
2 CONC 1764.
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524390#page/n119/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1903; Vol. III; page 101
