2 CONT
2 CONT      Colonel Thomas Butler was the son of Walter Butler and Mary Plunkett. He married Lady Margaret Bourke, daughter of William Bourke, 7th Earl of Clanricarde and Lady Helen MacCarty.2
2 CONT
2 CONT      Colonel Thomas Butler lived at Kilcash, County Tipperary, Ireland.1
