1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''BRIAN KAVANAGH''', of Borris; born 1595; died 1662; married 1st, Elinor, daughter of Sir Thomas Colclough, Knt., of Tintern Abbey, by whom he had issue, two daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd, Elinor, daughter of Sir Edward Blancheville, Knt., of Blanchevillestown, Co Killkenny, and had further issue,
2 CONT * 1a MORGAN, his heir.
2 CONT * 3a Elizabeth; married Hon John Fitzpatrick, s of Brian, 6th Lord Upper Ossory.
2 CONT * 4a Alice.
2 CONT * 5a Mary; married Charles Kavanagh, of Carrickduff, 2nd son of Sir Morgan Cavanagh, of Clonmullen 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Kavanagh died 1 Dec 1662, and was s by His son, Morgan
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
