1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Hugh McDonald Fitzpatrick''' was born on May 7, 1666 in Ulster, County Tyrone, Northern Ireland, Northern Ireland, United Kingdom. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740634894 Col. Lawrence John Fitzpatrick, of Ca
2 CONC stletown] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-30067617293 Elizabeth Fitzpatrick]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34810067617 Elizabeth Fitzpatrick]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh married [https://www.geni.com/profile-120619911 Perhaps NOT - Lady Ella Fitzpatrick]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-120619523 William FitzPatrick, I]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1698 in Maryland, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Lovey Fitzpatrick - daughter of Thomas Fitzpatrick who was a son of William (died 1764) who came from Ireland, told descendants of her sister Karen Huppock Fitzpatrick (who married James Pugh) that her father was descended from Si
2 CONC r John and Lady Ella Fitzpatrick (see Earl of Ossory). Adding documentation. Please wait for comments. 
2 CONT
