2 CONC aniel Price and Mary his wife of Cumberland Parish in Lunenburg Co. to HENRY BLAGRAVE of same place, £50, 400 acres in Lunenburg Co., granted Phillip Poindexter 10 Sept. 1755, at Tandy Walker’s corner on Juniper Creek, just above 
