2 CONC nn and Jonathan Patterson were appointed to take the said lists for “this present year.” At May Court, 1768, David Garland, HENRY BLAGROVE, Thomas Chambers, Thomas Winn and Jonathan Patterson, gentlemen, were the appointees.
