2 CONC , 1763-1770, contributed by Robert Y. Clay, Richmond, Virginia: The following paper endorsed “Oaths to the Government and Test” was recently found among a miscellaneous collection of Lunenburg County loose papers at the Virginia S
2 CONC tate Archives. It is unusual in that it contains the original signatures of the individuals. Feby 9th 1764 – HENRY BLAGRAVE (among others) May 10th 1764 – HENRY BLAGRAVE (among others) Mar 14th 1765 – HENRY BLAGRAVE (among others)
