2 CONC were taken by: Elisha Betts, Christopher Billups, HENRY BLAGROVE, Richard Claiborne, Everard Dowsing, Lodowick Farmer, Charles Hamlin, Capt. Jonathan Patteson, John Ragsdale and Thomas Winn.
