1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Richard Waldron (1650 – 3 November 1730) (Son of Richard) was a military officer, politician, and business man of the Province of New Hampshire.  
2 CONT
2 CONT His first wife was Hannah, daughter of President John Cutt.[b] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (second) at Portsmouth, 6 February 1692/3 Eleanor (or Ellenor) daughter of Major William Vaughan and grand niece of John Cutt and a cousin, once removed, of Hannah.[6] She was the mother of all her husband's children ex
2 CONC cept Samuel, her cousin Hannah's child. Her children included Richard Waldron (Secretary).[7]
2 CONT
