1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Orby was the widow of General John Hunter's then commanding officer and an heiress. Through her, General Hunter inherited estates at Croyland Abbey, Lincolnshire and at Chertsey, Surry, England. (source: 
2 CONC biography of General Robert Hunter by Professor Mary Lou Lustwig, an American academic).
