1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==concerns==
2 CONT '''Date and place of death have been reported to be the following.  It is unclear which (if any) are correct.  Further research is warranted:
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''July 30, 1730 at Costessey, Norfolk, England <attested on his Find A Grave memorial>
2 CONT * '''August 30, 1730 at an unspecified location <attested on Stirnet's "Jerningham2" page>
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Date and place of birth have also been (erroneously?) reported to be 1649 at Cossey Hall, Norfolk, England <unattested, conflicts with his Find A Grave memorial>.
2 CONT
