2 CONT Christopher Roper, 5th Baron Teynham was the son of Christopher Roper, 4th Baron Teynham and Philadelphia Mill.1 He married Hon. Elizabeth Browne, daughter of Francis Browne, 3rd Viscount Montagu and Lady Elizabeth Somerset, in 16
2 CONC 74. He died before 24 July 1689. Christopher Roper, 5th Baron Teynham gained the title of 5th Baron Teynham.
