1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Theodora Oxenbridge Thacher BIRTH	25 Jul 1659, England DEATH	18 Nov 1697 (aged 38), Milton, Norfolk County, Massachusetts, USA BURIAL	Milton Cemetery, Milton, Norfolk County, Massachusetts, USA, MEMORIAL ID 2114796
2 CONC 1,  by GreenMountainGal & David Leggett
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodora Oxenbridge, only child of Rev. John Oxenbridge and his second wife Frances Woodward, was b. in England on July 25, 1659. She d. at Milton, Mass. on Nov. 18, 1697, Æ 39.
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodora m. Rev. Peter Thacher on Nov. 21, 1677 probably at Boston where her father had been pastor of the Boston First Church (d. Dec. 28, 1674) and where his father was then pastor of the Boston 3rd (Old South) Church. They had 
2 CONC at least eight children, who are outlined in their father's memorial.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents John Oxenbridge 1609–1674
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse Peter Thacher 1651–1727
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Elizabeth Thacher Niles 1683–1716 Peter Thacher 1688–1744 Thomas Thacher 1693–1721
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription: "Mrs. Theodora Thacher ye daughter of ye Rev'd Mr John Oxenbridge Past'r of ye First Church in Boston & Wife of Mr. Peter Thacher aged 38 years 3 months 25 days was Translated from Earth to Heaven Nov'r ye 18th 1697."
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Oxenbridge
2 CONT
2 CONT His daughter Theodora married Peter Thacher (1651-1727).[15]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT #https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/21147961/theodora-thacher
