1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT <strong>Sir William Clerke, Baronet [1660]</strong>, of Shabbington, Bucks, s. and h., b. 9 July 1643 ; presumably matric. at Oxford (Triu. Coll.), 31 July 1658 ; suc. to the Baronetcy, 7 Oct. 1667. He m., in or before 1662, Eliza
2 CONC beth, da. of William Muschamp, of Row Barnes, Surrey. He d. at Stoke, Surrey, 6 Sep. 1678, aged 35, and was bur. at Shabbington. Will dat. 16 May, proved 14 Sep. 1678. His widow was living in 1695. The will of " Dame Elizabeth Gie
2 CONC rke, Midx.," pr. June 1708, possibly refers to her.
2 CONT
