2 CONT
2 CONT DEED BOOK E 1751-1761 page 193 June 5, 1753. Edward Herndon and
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary, his wife, of Spts. Co., to Joseph Herndon of sd.County.
2 CONT
2 CONT œ10 curr. Lot No. 3 in Spts. Co., adjoining lot No. 56 of the
2 CONT
2 CONT town of Fredksbg.Benjamin Davis, Isaac Scot, Richard Blanton.
