1 NOTE Grandson of namesake,Governor Edward Digges.
2 CONT
2 CONT In Dr. Casey's book, p. 561, he states that JAMES LEA son of WILLIAM LEA & (FRANCES MAJOR) b. St. Stephen's Parish, King & Queen Co VA, c. 1707 d Caswell Co N.C. early 1792, m. King & Queen Co Va c 1731 ANNE HERNDON dau of EDWARD 
2 CONC HERNDON and his 1st wife MARY WALLER.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.richey-herndon.com/tree/bio.asp&#00063;ID=I1711 states that Edward was
2 CONT A GREAT GRANDFATHER of Presidents George Bush And Geo.W Bush
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage date source:
2 CONT "Metts Ancestors in America"
2 CONT The Direct Line
2 CONT Fifth Edition by,
2 CONT Colonel Albert Caswell Metts, Jr.
2 CONT San Antonio, TX
2 CONT 1984
2 CONT pg 217
2 CONT "Edward Herndon married Mary Waller 1698."
2 CONT
2 CONT I have more than one source for Edward.
2 CONT John Herndon ( Herndons@acun.com)
2 CONT John Goodwin's book...Herndons of the American Revolution
2 CONT Edenfield Genealogical Society (james @edenfield.org)
2 CONT P.O. Box 6996
2 CONT Warner Robins, Ga. 31095
2 CONT Grandson of namesake,Governor Edward Digges.
2 CONT
