1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Digges, Dudley, son of Dudley Digges Esq., and Susannah Cole, his wife, was justice of Goochland in 1735, Burgess for the county in 1732, and in 1741 qualified as an attorney-at-law. He married Mary Hubard, daughte
2 CONC r of James Hubard, of York county, and left several children, who died without issue. One of them Maria Digges, was stewardess of William and Mary College. 
2 CONT
