2 CONT 1687-1691 Lancaster County Order Book 3: pg 158 Lancaster county Court 11th of March 1690/1691
2 CONT
2 CONT - Upon the peticon of JOHN PINCKARD as marrieing ELLINOR HARRISON, Daughter of Mr. DANIELL HARRISON, (deced), for the Estate belonging to his saide Wife out of her saide Fathers Estate in the possession of Major EDWARD DALE, It is
2 CONC  therefore ordered with the consent of the saide DALE that the same bee forthwth: paide by him unto the saide PINCKARD with costs
2 CONT
