2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The parish register of Christ Church, Middlesex County, Va., from 1653 to 1812 “Humphry Jones y*" Sone of Humphry & {unnamed} Jones borne in Lancaster County & bap" in Middlesex County at Mr Jones his house p. Mr Shepard 11th marc
2 CONC h 1683”
2 CONT
