2 CONT
2 CONT "Joseph Carter, Gent., of White Chapter Parish, Lancaster, made his will, Jan 12, 1764, which was probated Aug. 19, 1765.  he gave his plantation in Stafford to son Jeremiah, and divided his lands i n Lancaster between his sons Jo
2 CONC seph, George and Henry.
2 CONT
