1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=146707083 Find a Grave]
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	1696 Lancaster County Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	1750 Lancaster County Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of William Rogers and Elizabeth Dale. Born before 1696 and died after 1750.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married George Mitchell before 1717 and married Edward Blakemore on September 11, 1717 in Lancaster County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Hannah Rogers was a direct descendant of King Henry III of England.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Thomas Blakemore m. Anne Gibbs Neville
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Hannah Blakemore m. (1) Thomas Flint, (2) William Biscoe
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Capt. John Blakemore m. (1) Ann Tomlin, (2) Lucy Morgan Carter
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Edward Blakemore, II m. (1) Hannah Stevens, (2) Jemima Neusom
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Joseph Blakemore, Sr. m. Anne Sanders 
2 CONT
