2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT (1) Edward BLAKEMORE, I  was born about 1695 in England, and after 1717 in Va, married Hannah ROGERS, daughter of William ROGERS and Elizabeth DALE.  Edward died in 1738 in Lancaster Co., Va.  Hannah was married to George MITCHELL
2 CONC  and Thomas HINES.  
2 CONT   Children:
2 CONT       2      i Thomas BLACKMORE was born in 1718 in Lancaster Co., Va, and on Nov 5, 1856,     
2 CONT                 married Anne NEVILLE.  
2 CONT       3     ii Sarah BLACKMORE was born about 1720 in Lancaster Co., Va.  
2 CONT       4    iii Hannah BLACKMORE was born about 1722 in Lancaster Co., Va, and on Jan 11,        
2 CONT                  1746 in Lancaster Co., Va, married Thomas FLINT who was born about 1725.   +     5     iv Edward BLACKMORE II was born about 1725. +     6      v John BLAKEMORE Capt. was born about 1730. +     7     vi Joseph BLA
2 CONC CKMORE Sr. was born in 1732.
