1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Thomas Culpeper  married Katherine Saint Leger, daughter of Warham Saint Leger, Knight, of Ulcombe, Kent, by Mary daughter of Rowland Hayward, Knight.[4] They had three sons, John, [Capt.] Alexander, Esq., and John, gent., and th
2 CONC ree daughters, Mary, Anne (wife of Christopher Danby), and Frances."[4]
