1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L15V-MQ8
2 CONT Brief Life History of Lewis'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Lewis Clothier was born in 1709, in Talbot, Maryland, British Colonial America, his father, Robert Clothier, was 29 and his mother, Jane Kemp, was 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sarah Ridgeway in 1729. They were the parents of at least 1 son,
2 CONT Robert Nap (Knapp?) Clothier 1733-1775
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Sarah, Lewis married 2nd wife widow Elizabeth  Erickson (Wilson) in 1765.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 19 August 1771, in Chester, Pennsylvania, British Colonial America, at the age of 62, and was buried in Chester, Pennsylvania, United States.
