1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===William Compton
2 CONT * Birth:	Circa 1606 - Of Bramblereign, Sussex, Eng
2 CONT * Parents:	Henry Compton, Cecily Compton (born Sackville)
2 CONT * Siblings:	Richard Compton, Anne Putnam (born Compton), Cecily Arundel (born Compton), Henry Compton, George Compton, Mary Lumley (born Compton), Margaret Sackville (born Compton), Anne Kenny (born Putnam)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://thepeerage.com/p2395.htm#i23942
2 CONT
2 CONT Colonel Henry Compton was the son of Hon. Sir Henry Compton and Lady Cicely Sackville.1 He died on 13 May 1652, killed in a duel.1
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT "My grandson William Compton" was a legatee in the 1618 will of his grandmother, Anne
2 CONT Countess Dowager of Dorset (nee Anne Spencer):
2 CONT
2 CONT >Item, I give unto my grandchild, William Compton, all those my manors, lands, tenements and hereditaments which I have purchased within the county of Lincoln, to have and to hold to him and his heirs according to such uses, inten
2 CONC ts and purposes as are expressed and limited in a certain deed of feoffment and other indentures tripartite for the raising of eight thousand pounds for the portions of Cicely Compton and Anne Compton, likewise my grandchildren, a
2 CONC nd also to the other uses in the said indentures expressed, which said indentures bear date the nineteenth day of February in the fifteenth year of the reign of the King’s Majesty that now is of England, and of Scotland the one an
2 CONC d fiftieth, one thousand six hundred and seventeen; 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Research notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Probably not the man who married Elizabeth Waldron in Hampshire in 1622:
2 CONT
2 CONT >William Compton of Fisherton Anger Wilts husb & Eliza Waldron of Romsey sp, Chris W of R yeo bond, at R, 16 Oct 1622.
