2 CONT '''     Cicely Compton was born circa 1610.1 She was the daughter of''' Hon. Sir Henry Compton and Lady Cicely Sackville.1 '''She married, secondly, Henry Arundell, 3rd Baron Arundell of Wardour''', son of Thomas Arundell, 2nd Bar
2 CONC on Arundell of Wardour and Lady Blanche Somerset.1 '''She married, firstly, Sir John Fermor.2 She died on 24 March 1675/76.1 She was buried on 1 April 1676 at Tisbury, Wiltshire, England'''G.2
2 CONT '''     Her married name became Fermor.2 After her marriage, Cicely Compton was styled as Baroness Arundell of Wardour. Her married name became Arundell.'''1
2 CONT '''Children of Cicely Compton and Henry Arundell, 3rd Baron Arundell of Wardour'''
2 CONT 1. Hon. Henry Arundell3
2 CONT 2. Hon. Cicely Arundell3 d. 1717
2 CONT 3. Thomas Arundell, 4th Baron Arundell of Wardour+1 b. 1633, d. 10 Feb 1711/12
