2 CONC orothy, da. of Hon. Henry Hastings of Woodlands, Dorset, wid. of Sir John Ryves of Damory Court, Dorset. m. (1) ''Anne, da. of Sir Edward Lewis of Edington, Wilts., s.p''.;
2 CONT # https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Tregonwell_(died_1682)
