2 CONT Brief Life History of Isabella
2 CONT
2 CONT When Lady Isabella Sackville was born on 6 October 1622, in London, England, United Kingdom, her father, Sir Richard Sackville, 3rd Earl of Dorset, was 33 and her mother, Lady Anne Clifford, was 32. She married Lord James L. Compt
2 CONC on on 5 July 1642, in St James' Church, Clerkenwell, London, England, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 14 October 1661, in Compton Castle, Devon, England, United Kingdom, at the
2 CONC  age of 39, and was buried in Withyham, East Sussex, England, United Kingdom.
