1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Francis Howard, 1st Earl of Effingham==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Brigadier-General Francis Howard, 1st Earl of Effingham (bapt. 20 October 1683 – 12 February 1743) was an English peer and army officer.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Francis was the second son of Francis Howard, 5th Baron Howard of Effingham. On 26 July 1722, he was commissioned captain and lieutenant-colonel in the 3rd Regiment of Foot Guards. Howard succeeded as Baron Howard of Effingham 
2 CONC in 1725, with the death of his older brother Thomas Howard.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''He continued to rise in the Army, and was made lieutenant and lieutenant-colonel in the 1st Troop of Horse Grenadier Guards on 15 July 1731. He was created Earl of Effingham on 8 December of that year, and made a Deputy Earl Ma
2 CONC rshal on 13 December. The next year, on 22 July 1732, he received the colonelcy of a regiment of foot, which he held until 1737. On 21 June 1737, he became Captain and Colonel of the 2nd Troop Horse Grenadier Guards, with the rank
2 CONC  of a colonel of horse, and was promoted brigadier-general on 2 July 1739. On 22 December 1740, he became Captain and Colonel of the 4th Troop of Horse Guards. He died in February 1743, and was succeeded by his eldest son Thomas, 
2 CONC then an officer in the Horse Grenadier Guards.
2 CONT
2 CONT From: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francis_Howard,_1st_Earl_of_Effingham
2 CONT
2 CONT _____________________
2 CONT *'''Francis Howard, 1st Earl of Effingham1
2 CONT *'''M, #27066, b. 20 October 1683, d. 12 February 1742/43
2 CONT *Last Edited=24 Mar 2011
2 CONT *'''     Francis Howard, 1st Earl of Effingham was born on 20 October 1683.1 He was the son of Francis Howard, 6th Baron Howard of Effingham and Philadelphia Pelham.1 He married, firstly, Diana O'Farrell, daughter of Maj.-Gen. Fer
2 CONC gus O'Farrell, on 23 February 1713.1 He married, secondly, Anne Bristow, daughter of Robert Bristow, on 23 May 1728.1 He died on 12 February 1742/43 at age 59.1
2 CONT *'''     He succeeded to the title of 8th Baron Howard of Effingham, co. Surrey [E., 1554] on 13 July 1725.1 He held the office of Deputy Earl Marshal in 1731.1 He was created 1st Earl of Effingham, co. Surrey [Great Britain] on 8
2 CONC  December 1731.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Francis Howard, 1st Earl of Effingham and Diana O'Farrell
2 CONT **Thomas Howard, 2nd Earl of Effingham+1 b. 1714, d. 19 Nov 1763
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S37] BP2003 volume 1, page 1277. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p2707.htm#i27066 __________________
