2 CONT *'''Christened	20 Oct 1683 	Kensington, Middlesex, England
2 CONT *'''Died	12 Feb 1743  [1] 
2 CONT *'''Buried	13 Feb 1743 	Great Bookham, Surrey, England  [2] 
2 CONT *Father	Francis Howard, Baron Howard of Effingham,   c. 17 Sep 1643, Great Bookham, Surrey, England d. 30 Mar 1695  (Age ~ 51 years) 
2 CONT *Mother	Philadelphia Pelham,   c. 6 Oct 1654, St. Michael's, Lewes, Sussex, England   d. 13 Aug 1685, at sea  (Age ~ 30 years) 
2 CONT *'''Family 1	Diana O'Farrell,   b. of, , , Ireland
2 CONT *'''Married	23 Feb 1713 	St. James', Piccadilly, Westminster, Middlesex, England  [1] 
2 CONT *Children 	
2 CONT **	1. Thomas Howard, Earl of Effingham,   b. Abt 1714,   d. 19 Nov 1763  (Age ~ 49 years)
2 CONT *'''Family 2	Annie Bristow,   d. 15 Nov 1774, Hampton Court, Hampton, Middlesex, England
