2 CONT Bridget Monson was born circa 1674.1 She was the daughter of Sir John Monson and Judith Pelham.1 She married Sir Charles Barrington, 5th Bt., son of Thomas Barrington and Lady Anne Rich, on 20 April 1693 at St. Bride's, Fleet Stre
2 CONC et, London, England.1 She died in December 1699.1     From 20 April 1693, her married name became Barrington.1
