1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sir John Gage, 4th Bt.''' was the son of Sir Thomas Gage, 2nd Bt. and Mary Chamberlain. He married, firstly, Mary Middlemore, daughter of Robert Middlemore and Henrietta Maria Drummond. He married, secondly, Mar
2 CONC y Stanley, daughter of Sir William Stanley, 1st Bt.. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded to the title of  4th Baronet Gage, of Firley, co. Sussex [E., 1622] on 22 November 1660. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He held the office of Sheriff of Sussex from 1687 to 1688.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 27 May 1699.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir John Gage, 4th Bt. and Mary Middlemore
2 CONT * Bridget Gage d. 18 Nov 1732
2 CONT * Mary Gage d. b 1722
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir John Gage, 4th Bt. and Mary Stanley
2 CONT * Mary Gage d. c Dec 1716
2 CONT * Sir John Gage, 5th Bt. b. 1692, d. Jan 1700
2 CONT * Sir Thomas Gage, 6th Bt. b. c 1693/94, d. Oct 1713
2 CONT * Sir William Gage, 7th Bt. b. 1695, d. 23 Apr 1744
2 CONT
