1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Sir Thomas Gage, 3rd Baronet''' was born in 1637 in Firle, Sussex, England. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-38622371 Sir Thomas Gage, 2nd Baronet] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-38623572 Mary Gage]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34399990 Ann Cotton]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34637912073 Margaret Stapleton]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on November 22, 1660 in Rome, Roma, Lazio, Italy and was buried in Venerable English College, Rome,															Città Metropolitana di Roma Capitale,															Lazio,																Italy. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''References'''
