1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born at Chilston, near Madley, in Herefordshire. Baptism entered in register of the Church of the Nativity of the Blessed Virgin on 21st April 1635. Date of death not known. [Note: It is claimed that Thomas married
2 CONC  Mary Ap.Adam, daughter of John ApAdam of Flint and that they had a son,George Moore, b.1666, George is said to have emigrated to Ireland where he settled at Ballina and married Catherine,daughter of Robert Maxwell of Castle Feeli
2 CONC ng, Scotland. This line eventually gave rise to the Moores of Moore Hall in County Mayo, Ireland.]
2 CONT
2 CONT [For further information see "The family and Descendants of St. Thomas More" by Martin Wood. pp.203-207, Published in the UK by 'Gracewing'. April 2008.]
