1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bridget HUNGERFORD
2 CONT *  born 1610 in Down Ampney, Gloucestershire, England
2 CONT * Father: Sir Anthony HUNGERFORD Knight b 1687
2 CONT * Mother: Elizabeth LUCY born 1588 in Charlecote, Warwickshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 
2 CONT # Edmund DUNCH Lord Burnell on 8 Feb 1629 in St. Ann Blackfriars, London, Middlesex, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT >"By 1635 Edmund Dunch had married the daughter and heir of Sir Anthony Hungerford, the son of Sir John*, almost certainly a wealthy match, although the claim that she inherited £60,000 on the subsequent death of her father is alm
2 CONC ost certainly an exaggeration.25"
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *  		F	i	 Lucy DUNCH 1 was christened 18 Apr 1631 in Down Ampney, Gloucestershire, England.
2 CONT *  		F	ii	 Elizabeth DUNCH was born 1634 in Little Wittenham, Berkshire, England.
2 CONT *  		M	iii	 Sir Hungerford DUNCH Knight was christened 20 Jan 1638 and died 9 Nov 1680.
2 CONT *  		M	iv	 Walter DUNCH was christened 1 2 Feb 1640 in St. Martin in the Fields, Westminster, Middlesex, England.
2 CONT *  		M	v	 Hermes DUNCH 1 was christened 2 29 Oct 1648 in St. Martin in the Fields, Westminster, Middlesex, England. He died 13 Apr 1667 in Christ Church, Oxford, Oxfordshire, England.
2 CONT *  		M	vi	 Henry DUNCH 1 was christened 2 11 Oct 1649 in St. Martin in the Fields, Westminster, Middlesex, England. He died 1686 in Newington, Oxfordshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~hwbradley/aqwg3020.htm
