1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Caleb FARLEY....1 Apr 1645-16 Mar 1712, b. in Woburn, MA, d. in Roxbury, MA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * parents:  George Farley & Christian Births
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. Rebecca HILL (b. ca. 1646 in Woburn,Middlesex Co., Massachusetts, dau. of Ralph HILL) on 5 Jul 1666 in Billerica, Middlesex Co., MA. Rebecca died on 29 Mar 1669. He m. (2nd) Lydia MOORE, dau. of Golden MOORE and Joanna CHAMP
2 CONC NEY (both formerly of Cambridge, MA), on 3 Nov 1669 at Billerica, Middlesex Co., MA.
