2 CONT
2 CONT This memorial will allow descendants to have a place to which can be referenced and information shared. 1st wife of Capt. William Raymond, daug. of Edward and Hannah (Moore) Bishop of Salem. Children: William (~1666-Jan 1701) Edwa
2 CONC rd (1668-1727) George (1670-1703) Hannah (1673-1680) Abigail (1676- ) --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT IN MEMORIES i. Hannah Bishop, bp. 12 April 1646;[57] d. probably Salem where she lived between 1676 (baptism of last child) and 1682 (husband remarried);[58] m. probably Salem where she lived about 1661, William1 Raymond,[59] b. c
2 CONC a. 1639,[60] d. Beverly 29 Jan. 1708/9 aged about 72 [sic].[61] He m. (2) probably Beverly by 1682, Ruth Hull, daughter of Isaac Hull.
2 CONT
