2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth was born about 1640. She is the daughter of Peter Glanfield and Margaret Unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth married Caleb Stevens in Maine. Upon his demise, she served as administrator of his estate on June 29,1675. Ruth and her father were bound for 150 pounds for debts owed by the estate pending the proceeds of sale of an earlier
2 CONC  fishing expedition.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth later married Mr. Henry Kirke, who kept an Ordinary house in the town of Dover. They continued living in the Stevens property until her son Caleb Stevens came of age and sold the place in 1692.
2 CONT
