2 CONT The Life Summary of John
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Greeley was born on 16 November 1670, in Salisbury, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Philip Greely, was 26 and his mother, Sarah Ilsley, was 26. He married Anne Collins on 23 Novembe
2 CONC r 1708, in Salisbury, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 4 daughters. He died on 10 February 1722, in his hometown, at the age of 51.
