2 CONT 22.   Timothy3 French (John2,  Edw.1), of Salisbury, b. 1681 ; m. 1st, April 29, 1708[S], Ruth3  Geeeley (Philip2,  Andrew1)  who d. May 30, 1716 [S] ; 2d, June 9, 1722, Mary Pike (Hugh) who survived him. He d. May 8, 1742 ; adm. 
