2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Greeley (Gr. Abigail, s. of Andre and Sarahle) Godfrey was born 24 June 1681 in Salisbury, Essex, Massachusetts, the daughter of Andrew Greeley and Sarah Brown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail married John Godfrey Jr, born. 5 May 1676, the son of John Godfrey and Mary Cox.
2 CONT
2 CONT All of the children of Abigail and John were born in Hampton, Rockingham county, New Hampshire:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ebenezer Godfrey, born 23 Jul 1706
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Godfrey Redman, born 21 Jun 1708
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Godfrey, born on 28 Dec 1710
2 CONT
2 CONT Rachel Godfrey born on 26 Nov 1712, died young
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Godfrey French, born 28 Apr 1715
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT John Godfrey, born 30 Apr 1717
2 CONT
2 CONT Moses Godfrey, (twin) born 11 Oct 1719
2 CONT
2 CONT Mehitable Godfrey, (twin) born 11 Oct 1719
2 CONT
2 CONT Rachel Godfrey baptized 22 Sep 1723 (note: second child of this name in this family)
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail died about 1775 in Hampton, Rockingham, New Hampshire.
2 CONT
