2 CONT Samuel Greeley Sr (1695 - 1771) 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Deacon Samuel Greeley Sr aka Greele===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 22 Dec 1695 in Haverhill, Essex, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Joseph Greele and Martha (Wilford) Greeley
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Joseph Greeley, Benjamin (Greele) Greeley, Hannah Greeley, Moses Greeley, Miriam Greeley, Martha Greeley, Ruth (Greeley) Hutchins, Moses Greeley and Mary Greeley
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Rachel (Robinson) Greele — married 1719 (to 19 Sep 1758) in Haverhill, Essex, Massachusetts Bay [uncertain]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Jane (French) Greele — married 19 Apr 1759 (to 12 Jun 1762) in Hillsborough, New Hampshire
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Susanah (Hamblin) Greele — married 9 Jan 1764 in Hudson, Hillsborough, New Hampshire
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Samuel Greeley, Meriam Greeley, Mehitable (Greeley) Hamblett, Martha (Greeley) Spaulding, Rachel (Greeley) Marshall, Jonathan Greeley, Mary Greeley, Hannah Greeley and Nathaniel Greeley
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 25 May 1771 at age 75 in Hudson, Hillsborough, New Hampshire
