2 CONT Hannah Greeley (1702 - 1738)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Hannah Greeley===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 12 Jul 1702 in Haverhill, Essex, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Joseph Greele and Martha (Wilford) Greeley
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Samuel Greeley Sr, Joseph Greeley, Benjamin (Greele) Greeley, Moses Greeley, Miriam Greeley, Martha Greeley, Ruth (Greeley) Hutchins, Moses Greeley and Mary Greeley
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Bradbury — married 13 Feb 1724 in Haverhill, Essex, Province of Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Roland Bradbury, Martha (Bradbury) Lowell, Sarah (Bradbury) Lowell, Jemima (Bradbury) Sargent and Mary Bradbury
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 1738 at about age 35 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 16:35: David Greeley edited the Biography for Hannah Greeley (1702-1738). (Spelling of marriags) [Thank David for this]
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) William 3 Bradbury (William 2 , Thomas 1 ), married March 16, 1697, Sarah, daughter of Rev. John Cotton, jr., and sister of Mariah Cotton ante. She was born April 5, 1670, and died Feb. 21, 1733. He died April 20, 1756. He resi
2 CONC ded at Salisbury.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children :
2 CONT
2 CONT John (4) , b. June 30, 1699 ; m. Hannah Greely.
2 CONT
