2 CONT 1. Rowland, b. Jan. 15, 1725 ; m. Mary Stevens.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Martha, b. Feb. 3, 1727.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Sarah, b. June 21, 1730.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Jemima 5 , b. Feb. 4, 1735 ; m. Dec. 1, 1754, Nathan Sargent of Amesbury.
2 CONT
