2 CONT
2 CONT 1694: Daniel Denison married Mary Wetherell at New London Village (New London) Connecticut Colony. Children, born at New London: 1) Grace; born January 4, 1695; married July 30, 1713, Edward Hallam at New London; 2) Phebe; born Ma
2 CONC rch 3, 1696; married January 12, 1720, Gibson Harris at New London; died January 4, 1761 at Bozrah Center. New London; 3) Hannah; born March 28, 1698; married September 4, 1718, John Hough; died April, 9 1782 at Bozrah Center; 4) 
2 CONC Borodel; born May 17, 1701; married April 6, 1721, Jonathan Latimer at New London; 5) Daniel (see below; 6) Wetherell; born August 24, 1705; married November 9, 1726, Lydia Moore; 7) Ann; born August 11, 1707; married (1st) Januar
2 CONC y 7, 1725, Jabez Hough; married (2nd); May 9, 1726, Samuel Richards; died 1786; and 8) Sarah; born June 20, 1710; married March 4, 1731, William Douglas; died May 12, 1797.
2 CONT
