2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann /Denison [1][2][3][4] was born Oct. 3, 1684 at Stonington, New London, Connecticut.[5] She was the eighth child of John Denison and Phebe Lay.
2 CONT
2 CONT Christening
2 CONT
2 CONT 13 FEB 1685
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann Denison was thrice married, all at Stonington:
2 CONT
2 CONT First, 7 Apr 1702, to Samuel Minor, of Stonington; no children have been identified from this marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Second, 2 Mar 1718 to Edward Denison of Westerly, Rhode Island; no children [6]
2 CONT
2 CONT Third, 16 Jul 1734 to Lt. Jere Ripley
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann (Denison/Miner/Denison) Ripley died 16 Jul 1734 at Stonington.
2 CONT
