2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Fenner was born in 1693, in Cranston, Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, his father, Thomas Fenner, was 41 and his mother, Dinah Borden, was 28. He married Waite Harris about 1715. They were the parent
2 CONC s of at least 3 sons and 3 daughters. He died on 22 June 1779, in Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 86, and was buried in Major Thomas Fenner Burying Ground, Cranston, Providence, Rhode Island, United States.
