2 CONT Brief Life History of Sarah
2 CONT When Sarah Fenner was born in 1698, in Providence, Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, her father, Thomas Fenner, was 46 and her mother, Dinah Borden, was 33. She married Dr. John Jenckes in 1719. They were the par
2 CONC ents of at least 1 daughter. She died on 17 April 1736, in West Pawtucket, Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, at the age of 38, and was buried in North Burial Ground, Newport, Newport, Rhode Island, United States.
