2 CONT Hon. Arthur Fenner, Jr. and 1, Mary Olney 2, Barbara (Mason) Slade [ b 17 Oct. 1699; d 21 Jan. 1788] Arthur m 1st Mary Olney [b 30 Sept. 1704, d 18 Mar. 1756, age 54 yrs., 5 mos., 18 days] on 2 June 1723, by James Jenckes, Deputy 
2 CONC Governor. Mary was the daughter of Capt. James Olney and Hallelujah Brown. They lived in Providence and attended the First Baptist Church in America. Arthur m 2nd Barbara (Mason) Slade [d 3 May 1801 in her 83rd yr.], daughter of J
2 CONC oseph Mason and Elizabeth Barney and widow of William Slade, on 19 Dec. 1762. Barbara was buried in Somerset, RI.
