2 CONT Brief Life History of Anne
2 CONT
2 CONT When Anne Crawford was born on 13 May 1690, in Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, her father, Gideon Crawford, was 38 and her mother, Freelove Fenner, was 34. She married Peleg Carr on 29 November 1711, in Provide
2 CONC nce, Rhode Island, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 3 daughters. She lived in Rhode Island, United States in 1690 and Providence, Providence, Rhode Island, United States in 1690. She died on 1
2 CONC 4 September 1729, in Rhode Island, British Colonial America, at the age of 39, and was buried in Newport, Rhode Island, Rhode Island, British Colonial America.
