2 CONT When John Starkey Sr was born on 14 June 1711, in Saybrook, New London, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Thomas Starkey Sr, was 23 and his mother, Hannah Fenner, was 19. He married Mary Williams on 12 Dece
2 CONC mber 1735, in Saybrook, New London, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 2 daughters. He died on 29 September 1797, in Essex, Middlesex, Connecticut, United States, at the age 
2 CONC of 86, and was buried in Essex, Middlesex, Connecticut, United States.
