2 CONT ==concerns==
2 CONT '''This Mary apparently should not be confused with https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Beckwith/6000000006348497681 (shown here as a sister).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Find A Grave reports that Daniel Starlin married this Mary and her sister (the aforementioned) Marah "Mary" in the same year.  That does not seem correct.  Further research is warranted.
2 CONT
