2 CONT ==concerns==
2 CONT '''This Marah "Mary" apparently should not be confused with https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Lay-Starlin/6000000003243274806 (shown here as a sister).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Find A Grave reports that Daniel Starlin married this Marah "Mary" and her sister (the aforementioned) Mary Merah in the same year.  That does not seem correct.  Further research is warranted.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Given name has also been reported to be '''Mary''' (which was her pet name).
2 CONT
