1 NAME Joseph /Larabee/
2 GIVN Joseph
2 SURN Larabee
2 _MARNM Larabee
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 MAR 1692
2 PLAC Windham, Windham, CT
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 9 JAN 1778
2 PLAC Coventry, Tolland, CT
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Lahrabee was born March 27, 1692 in Windham. to John Larrabee and Sarah Morgan.
2 CONT
2 CONT On November 24, 1720, he married Judith Andrew.
2 CONT
2 CONT They lived at Windham until about 1726, then at Coventry.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had, the first four recorded at Windham, the others at Coventry:
2 CONT
2 CONT Zerviah, b. 17 Sept. 1721; m. 25 Jan. 1742/3 Ebenezer Grover. Joseph, b. 26 Aug. 1723; d. 2 Sept. 1726. David, b. 2 July 1725; d. 11 Sept. 1726. Judith, b. 27 Aug. 1727; m. 27 Mar. 1746 Ebenezer Shailer. Seth, b. 22 Apr. 1729. Abi
2 CONC gail, b. 9 Feb. 1732/3; m. 18 Dec. 1751 Ebenezer Lamb. Jabez, b. 11 July 1734; d. 3 July 1750. Enoch, b. 23 Oct. 1736; m. 19 Oct. 1756 Mary Gera of Somers. Ebenezer (twin), b. 26 Feb. 1738/9. Richard (twin), b. 26 Feb. 1738/9; m. 
2 CONC 20 Feb. 1757 Mary Webster of Lebanon. Judith died on November 3, 1763. Joseph married second on November 23, 1764 Widow Bill of Coventry, who was probably Ruth, third wife of Philip Bill (who died in 1762). Ruth, wife of Joseph La
2 CONC rra bee, d. 30 Jan. 1765 in 56th year (Coventry town records).
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph died in January of 1778.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Larrabee-1420
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Joseph Larrabee (1692 - 1778)
2 CONT ===
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Larrabee
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 27 Mar 1692 in Windham, Windham, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John Larrabee and Sarah (Morgan) Larrabee
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of John Larrabee
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Judith (Andrews) Larrabee — married 24 Nov 1720 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Ruth (Unknown) Larrabee — married 23 Nov 1764 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Zerviah (Larrabee) Grover, Joseph Larrabee, David Larrabee, Judith (Larrabee) Shailer, Seth Larrabee, Abigail (Larrabee) Brown, Jabez Larrabee, Enoch Larrabee, Richard Larrabee and Ebenezer Larrabee
2 CONT
2 CONT Died Jan 1778 in Coventry, Tolland, Connecticut, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 23 Sep 2019 | Created 11 Dec 2017
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT Goodell, Mrs. Harriet Andross. John2 Andrews of Ipswich, Mass., and Norwich, Conn., and Some of His Descendants, NEHGR (1916) Vol. 70, Page 106
2 CONT Genealogies of Connecticut Families (Genealogical Pub. Co., 1983) Vol. 1, Page 39
