2 CONT ----
2 CONT Mary Tillinghast (Isabel Sayles, Mary Williams, Roger Williams) was born Aug 1689; she married Gov. Richard Ward 2 Nov 1709 at Newport, RI; she died 19 Oct 1767 at Newport, RI, at age 78.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Tillinghast and Gov. Richard Ward were as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     320  i.   Amey Ward was born Sep 1710; she died 22 Oct 1710.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     321  ii.   Thomas Ward was born 24 Oct 1711; he married Content Coggeshall 1736.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     322  iii.   Mary Ward was born 10 Dec 1713; she married Ebenezer Flagg.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     323  iv.   Elizabeth Ward was born 19 Feb 1715; she died 1715.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     324  v.   Amey Ward was born 21 Feb 1717; she married Samuel Vernon.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     325  vi.   Isabel Ward was born 19 Sep 1719; she married Huxford Marchant circa 1746; she died 5 Feb 1808 at age 88.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     326  vii.   Hannah Ward was born 24 Sep 1721; she died 27 Dec 1783 at age 62.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     327  viii.   John Ward was born 4 Aug 1723; he died 15 Aug 1724 at age 1.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     328  ix.   Samuel Ward was born 27 May 1725; he married Anna Ray, daughter of Simon Ray and Deborah Greene.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     329  x.   Mercy Ward was born 3 Jun 1727; she died 25 Oct 1730 at age 3.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     330  xi.   Margaret Ward was born 14 Apr 1729; she married Richard Power 13 Jun 1748; she married Samuel Freebody 1 Jan 1765; she died 27 Jun 1765 at age 36.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     331  xii.   Richard Ward was born 22 Jan 1730/31; he died 7 Aug 1732 at age 1.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     332  xiii.   Henry Ward was born 27 Dec 1732; he married Esther Freebody.
2 CONT
2 CONT     *     333  xiv.   Elizabeth Ward was born 6 Jun 1735; she married William Bliss; she died 18 Feb 1815 at age 79.
2 CONT
