2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia (or Lidia) Odlin was born at Newport, Rhode Island, in 1701, a daughter of John and Lydia Odlin. She married Joseph Sanford in 1722; surviving her husband by more than fifteen years, Lydia (Odlin) Sanford lived through the A
2 CONC merican Revolution, dying at Newport in the spring of 1781.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia (Odlin) Sanford (1701 - 1781)
