2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Joseph Sanford — married 8 Feb 1722 in Newport, Rhode Island
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Sarah (Sanford) Rogers, Frances (Sanford) Thurston and Martha (Sanford) Thurston
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 20 May 1781 at age 80 [location unknown]
