2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Abigail
2 CONT
2 CONT When Abigail Sheldon was born in 1696, in Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, her father, Nicholas Sheldon Sr, was 27 and her mother, Abigail Tillinghast, was 22. She married Judge Richard "Red" Fenner on 11 Januar
2 CONC y 1715, in Providence, Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 2 daughters. She died in 1744, in Johnston, Providence, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, at the age of 
2 CONC 48, and was buried in Major Thomas Fenner Burying Ground, Cranston, Providence, Rhode Island, United States.
