2 CONT Freelove (Tillinghast) Allen
2 CONT Born about 1702 [uncertain] in Providence, Providence, Rhode Island
2 CONT Died 26 May 1748 at about age 46 in North Kingstown, Washington, Rhode Island 
2 CONT
2 CONT Freelove Allen formerly Tillinghast 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Joseph Tillinghast and Freelove (Stafford) Tillinghast
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Lydia (Tillinghast) Almy, Joseph Tillinghast Jr., Samuel Tillinghast, Nicholas Tillinghast [half] and Daniel Tillinghast [half] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of William Allen — married 1718 in Rhode Island 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Thomas Allen and Freelove (Allen) Kenyon 
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Freelove was the daughter of Joseph and Freelove (Stafford) Tillinghast
2 CONT
2 CONT She married William Allen, son of William and Martha (Sweet) Allen, about 1718 in Rhode Island - parents of Jonathan, John, Thomas and Ann Allen
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
