1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Tillinghast-98
2 CONT
2 CONT John Tillinghast
2 CONT * Born 14 Apr 1696 in West Greenwich, Rhode Island and Providence Plantation Colony
2 CONT * Son of Pardon Tillinghast and Mary (Keech) Tillinghast
2 CONT * Brother of Joseph Tillinghast, Mary (Tillinghast) Mawney, Mercy (Tillinghast) Brown and Philip Pardon Tillinghast	
2 CONT * Husband of Anne (Greene) Tillinghast — married 4 Apr 1714 (to 4 Mar 1719) in East Greenwich, Rhode Islandmap
2 CONT * Husband of Phoebe (Greene) Tillinghast — married 23 Jul 1719 (to 27 May 1733) in East Greenwich, Kent, Rhode Islandmap
2 CONT * Husband of Anne (Allen) Tillinghast — married 19 Jun 1731 in Rehoboth, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT * Father of Mary (Tillinghast) Cooper, Pardon Tillinghast, John Tillinghast, Anne (Tillinghast) Allen, Welthyan Tillinghast, Lydia Tillinghast, Benjamin Tillinghast, Charles Tillinghast and Thomas Tillinghast	
2 CONT * Died 21 Oct 1777 at age 81 in West Greenwich, Rhode Island and Providence Plantation Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage #1: was conducted by Randall Holden, Asst., in East Greenwich, Rhode Island. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage #2: Married: 23 Jul 1719 Phebe Greene John Tillinghast at Kent County, Rhode Island. [3] or 23 Jan 1719 or 21 Sept. 1719 [4][5]
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage #3: was conducted by John Spencer, Justice, in East Greenwich, Rhode Island
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Source:Arnold, James N. Vital Record of Rhode Island, 1636–1850'''
