2 CONT Pardon Tillinghast, son of Pardon Tillinghast (d. 1743) and his second wife, Sarah Reynolds, was born after 1699 at East Greenwich, Rhode Island.
2 CONT
2 CONT He Married Avis, daughter of Benjamin and Avis Norton.  Their children were:
2 CONT # Pardon, married Abigail Rogers
2 CONT # William, married Sarah Holmes 
2 CONT # Martha, married Benjamin Slocum 
2 CONT # Avis, married James Carpenter
