2 CONT "<strong>Sir John Beaumont Rayney, Baronet [E 1642 and S 1636], of Wrotham</strong>, son and heir, by his 1st wife, born about 1688; succeeded to the Baronetcies in February 1704/5, shortly after which he sold the estates of Wroth
2 CONC am Place, in Wrotham. He was Lieut. Col. in the army. He died in 1716."
2 CONT
