2 CONT Isabel Wood formerly Hazen
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 21 Jul 1662 in Rowley, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Edward Hazen and Hannah (Grant) Browne
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Elizabeth (Hazen) Harris, Hannah (Hazen) Gibson, John Hazen, Thomas Grant Hazen Sr., Edward Hazen, Priscilla (Hazen) Pearson, Edna (Hazen) Perkins, Richard Hazen, Hephzibah Hazen and	Sarah (Hazen) Wilcom
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Wood — married 16 Jan 1680 in Rowley, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Hannah (Wood) Bailey, John Wood, Priscilla (Wood) Tenny, Edward Wood, Thomas Wood, Samuel Wood, Samuel Wood, Joseph Wood, Ebenezer Wood, Abigail Annie (Wood) Tenney, Bethia (Wood) Bingham, Richard Wood and Josiah Wood
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 24 Jul 1735 in Rowley, Essex, Province of Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 27 Feb 2019 | Created 2 Dec 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT This person is an ancestor of President Millard Fillmore[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabel was born July 21, 1662 in Georgetown, Essex County, Massachusetts to Edward Hazen (Eng: 1614-1683 Mass) and Hannah Grant (Mass. 1626-1649).
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John Wood (1656-1729) on January 16, 1680 in Rowley, Essex, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of John Wood and Isabell Hazen are:
2 CONT
2 CONT John Wood born January 08, 1680 in Rowley, Essex, Massachusetts; died between 1680 - 1682.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Wood born January 12, 1681 in Rowley, Essex, Massachusetts; died March 03, 1732 in Bradford, Massachusetts. She married James Bailey July 14, 1702.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Wood born February 13, 1684 in Bradford, Essex, Massachusetts; died February 13, 1753.
2 CONT
2 CONT Priscilla Wood born August 27, 1686 in Bradford, Essex, Massachusetts; died between 1764-1780. She married Daniel Tenney.
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward Wood born September 07, 1689 in Bradford, Essex, Massachusetts; died 1762. He married Mary Spofford (b. 15 June 1692 in Rowley, Essex, Massachusetts; died 26 December 1779) Possibly married on 23 December 1713. Experience A
2 CONC bell is listed as his brother, Thomas's wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Wood born November 28, 1691 in Bradford, Essex, Massachusetts; died after 1764. Samuel Wood born November 18, 1693 in Bradford, Essex, Massachusetts; died November 03, 1778. He married Ruth Kimball on January 26, 1749. Jose
2 CONC ph Wood , born May 05, 1696 in Bradford, Essex, Massachusetts; died February 07, 1766 in Windham, Connecticut. He married Hannah Carrier. Ebenezer Wood , born May 08, 1698 in Bradford, Essex, Massachusetts; died Bet. 1737 - 1789 i
2 CONC n Norwich, Connecticut. He married Mary Rudd. Abigail Annie Wood , born December 14, 1700 in Bradford, Essex, Massachusetts. She married Joseph Tenney on February 14, 1723. Bethia Wood , born January 19, 1703 in Bradford, Essex, M
2 CONC assachusetts; died April 03, 1769 in Salisbury, Massachusetts. She married John Bingham on February 08, 1721. Richard Wood , born January 30, 1706 in Bradford, Essex, Massachusetts. He married Sarah Rolf. Josiah Wood, born April 0
2 CONC 5, 1708 in Bradford, Essex, Massachusetts; died Aft. 1767. He married Eleanor. Death
2 CONT
