1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Doctor Benjamin Ware, d. July 16, 1744 in the 57th year of his age.
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John Ware and his second wife, Joanna (Gay) Whiting Ware.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, first, on May 21,1730 at Stoughton,MA, Zabiah Billings. She was born on Oct 22,1711, a daughter of Ebenezer and Jerusha Billings of Stoughton. She died at Wrentham,MA on Dec 1,1738.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, second, on May 14,1741 at Wrentham,MA, Melatiah (Fisher) Ware, widow of Jonathan Ware. She was born at Wrentham,MA on Oct 6,1705, a daughter of Ebenezer Fisher and Abigail (Ellis) Fisher. Her third husband, married in 
2 CONC 1745, was Ephraim Leonard.
