2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT In Memory of Mrs.
2 CONT Esther wife of Ensn.
2 CONT Isaac Fisher who died
2 CONT Janry. 20th 1770
2 CONT in ye 74th year
2 CONT of her Age.
