1 NAME Rev. Nathaniel Huntting
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC East Hampton, Suffolk County, New York, United States of America
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 15 NOV 1675
2 ADDR
3 CITY Dedham
3 STAE Massachusetts
