1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Catherine-Wade/6000000007280840928?through=6000000025138417359 born 1689)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Wade was the son of James https://www.geni.com/people/James-Wade-Sr/6000000026365536296 and Martha Wade https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Wade/6000000023910167967?through=6000000026365536296.  
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT HENRY WADE SR was born 30 Jan 1688/89 in St Peter's Parish New Kent Co Virginia and died unknown. He married JUDITH VIA. She was born 11 Apr 1699 New Kent Co Virginia and died unknown. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of HENRY WADE SR & JUDITH VIA: 
2 CONT A. JOHN WADE b abt 1719 d unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT B. JOSEPH WADE b abt 1720 James City Co Virginia d 1757 Orange Co North Carolina
2 CONT
2 CONT C. RICHARD WADE b abt 1721 d bef 1768 St James Norrtham Parish Goochland Co Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT D. JAMES WADE b abt 1725 d unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT E. ROBERT WADE b abt 1730 St James Co Virginia d 1766 Halifax Co Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT F. HENRY WADE JR b abt 1740 Hanover Co Virginia m 30 Aug 1761 Hanover Co Virginia LUCY TURNER b 1744 Hanover Co Virginia
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT James Wade, Jr., who was born in 1697, could have been a brother of Henry Wade,
2 CONT who was born in New Kent County on 30 June 1689 and married Judith Via. Henry
2 CONT Wade was a son of James Wade of New Kent County, Virginia, who was born about
2 CONT 1665-1667 and had, at least, five children, son Henry Wade, who was born in New Kent
2 CONT County on 30 June 1689 and married Judith Via, who was born in New Kent County on
2 CONT 11 April 1699; son Anthony Wade; daughter Margaret Wade; daughter Mary Wade; and
2 CONT daughter Sarah Wade. Henry Wade and Judith Via had a son Henry Wade, Jr. who was
2 CONT born in Hanover County, Virginia, in 1740 and married Lucy Turner of Hanover County
2 CONT on 30 August 1761. Lucy Turner Wade was born in 1744, probably in Hanover County.
2 CONT (THE WADE QUARTERLY, Volume 6, Issue 1, June 1979, query by Irene Lovell Wade,
2 CONT St. Louis, MO; and Volume 4, Issue 1, June 1977, data of Barbara Gates, Seattle, WA,
2 CONT including excerpt from a Bible possessed by Florence Wade Becker, Bluefield, WV.)
2 CONT
