2 CONT
2 CONT === Col. Robert Wade Sr.
2 CONT *Born 20 Nov 1700 in James City, Virginia
2 CONT * Died 11 Apr 1768 in Halifax, Virginia
2 CONT *Son of James Wade Sr and Margaret Elizabeth (Mosby) Wade 
2 CONT * Husband of Elizabeth (Hampton) Wade — married 1722 in Virginia Colony
2 CONT * Father of Robert Wade, Hampton Wade, Martha Susannah (Wade) Walker, Charles Wade, Stephen Wade, Edward Wade, Andrew Wade Jr, John Wade, Mary Ann (Wade) Hunt, Robert Wade Jr, Sarah (Wade) Stokes and Edward Wade
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT There are some coincidences that suggest that Robert Wade Sr. of Halifax County, Virginia was Robert Wade Jr., the son of Robert and Elizabeth Sprigg Wade of Prince Georges County, Maryland.  It has been estimated that Robert Wade
2 CONC  Sr., who died about 1770 in Halifax County, was born about 1700.  Robert Wade Jr., son of Robert  Wade and Elizabeth Sprigg, was born in 1707.  Elizabeth, the wife of Robert Wade Sr. of Halifax County has been identified as, but 
2 CONC not proved to be, Elizabeth Hampton.  The wife of Robert Wade Jr. of Prince Georges has been identified as Elizabeth Hamilton.  
2 CONT
