2 CONT An excellent researcher, William Scroggins, states: "Circumstances suggest that James Wade of New Kent and Hanover counties, Virginia,were the same person but it has not been proved. Coincident facts of time and place indicate tha
2 CONC t the following contemporaries could have been his sons:
