2 CONT -1-4 DAWSON WADE SR b 1732 Botetort Co Va d 8 Dec 1819, Montgomery Co Ky m1/?2 Rachel Burnsides b 1735 Augusta Co Va + 3 ch dau of Robert Burnsides and Esther Mayse m2/?1 Abigail Alexander dau of James Alexander
