1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 6.RICHARD4 WADE (ANDREW3, EDWARD2, EDWARD1) was born Abt. 1704, and died 15 Nov 1757 in Goochland County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Wade was only married to Grissel (maiden name unproven). She is named in his will, and left her own will in Goochland co. He was never married to Elizabeth Edgar.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married
2 CONT * (1) GRISELLE [DABNEY?] 1723 in Henrico County, Virginia.She was born Abt. 1704, and died 15 Mar 1768 in Goochland County, Virginia, No proof of parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of RICHARD WADE and GRISELLE DABNEY are: 
2 CONT * WILLIAM5 WADE, b. 1726, Goochland County, Virginia; d. Bef. 02 Nov 1771, Goochland County, Virginia.
2 CONT * RICHARD WADE, b. 1726, Goochland County, Virginia; d. 11 Sep 1794, Goochland County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of RICHARD WADE are: 
2 CONT # ELIZABETH5 WADE, b. Abt. 1730; d. Unknown; m. BENONI BOATWIGHT, Bef. 21 Aug 1755, Goochland County, Virginia; d. Unknown. More About BENONI BOATWIGHT and ELIZABETH WADE: Marriage: Bef. 21 Aug 1755, Goochland County, Virginia 
2 CONT # JOANNA WADE, b. 1730; d. Unknown; m. DEVREUX JERRAT, 26 Jan 1775, Goochland County, Virginia; d. Unknown. More About DEVREUX JERRAT and JOANNA WADE: Marriage: 26 Jan 1775, Goochland County, Virginia 
2 CONT # LUCY WADE, b. 1729; d. 1812; m. JOSEPH BARNET, 03 Oct 1754, Goochland County, Virginia; b. 1727; d. 1802 More About JOSEPH BARNET and LUCY WADE: Marriage: 03 Oct 1754, Goochland County, Virginia 
2 CONT # JOHN G WADE, b. 1731; d. 1818. 
2 CONT # JOSEPH WADE, b. 1731; d. Unknown; m. SUSANNA BOWLES, 15 Oct 1770, Goochland County, Virginia; d. Unknown.  Marriage Notes for JOSEPH WADE and SUSANNA BOWLES: The Douglas Register, pg. 48 list Wade, Jo: and Susanna Bowles, both i
2 CONC n Goochland Parish 1770, Oct. 15. The semicolon meant the name was shortened.Both Joseph and John Wade are listed as husbands to Susanna Bowles depending upon the source. 
2 CONT ----
