2 CONT
2 CONT JOSEPH WADE b Abt. 1690, James City Co VA d 1757 Orange Co VA (This part of the pedigree has been kept separte because it seems that either there were two different Josephs or that this Joseph had a second wife, Sarah Willis, by w
2 CONC hom at least Mary Willis Wade is likely to have been the daughter of Joseph. All sites so far including Joseph also show his daughter, Sarah, as having married a Fontaine, the author's line of descent, as well as the number of sib
2 CONC lings and the names of their spouses, but there are different opinions on where Joseph fits into this pedigree and who his wife was.) m Sarah Lide/Lied b 1693 in Va d 1765 dau of Robert Lide/Lied.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Wade b c 1690, James City Co Va lived Culpeper Co Va. and Orange Co NC. d between Jan and Mar 1757, Orange Co NC son of Wa10 = either James Wade, Andrew Wade, or Edward Wade b about 1665.  
2 CONT WILL: Orange Co, NC, WB A-67, Joseph Wade, dated 3 Jan 1757, proved Mar 1757; wife: Sarah 
2 CONT m Sarah Willis b 1713 Orange Co VA dau of-> Lived in Culpeper Co VA and Orange Co NC
2 CONT
2 CONT http://archiver.rootsweb.ancestry.com/th/read/WADE/1999-06/0928775396
2 CONT shows his wife as Sarah Lide dau of Robert Lide, but a daughter with the middle name Willis indicates Willis. Other trees show her as Sarah Winston. ----
