1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Thomas Lundy''' was born in 1697 in Isle of Wight County, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-29965485 Rev. James Lundy, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-29965486 Elizabeth Jane Flowers
2 CONC  / Lundy]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34852229479 Rebecca Lundy]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34852228070 Abraham Lundy]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on September 15, 1744 in Brunswick County, VA, United States. 
2 CONT ----
