1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Biography:
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Lundy was born about 1700 in Isle of Wight Co., Colony of Virginia, the son of James Lundy Sr. and Elizabeth Birchett. He died before 1783 in Southampton County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents - James Lundy and Elizabeth Burchett 
2 CONT
2 CONT ROBERT LUNDY, 145a, Isle of Wight Co., N. side of Maherin R. 19 Jun. 1735.
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: Robert could not have been born in 1690 as James Sr. did not leave England for the colonies until 1693. James' indenture contract did not end until late 1690s, and he married Elizabeth circa 1698 or 1699. Robert's will dated
2 CONC  May 1, 1783, and entered for probate October 9, 1783, indicates his death occurred before October 9. Corrections above reflect this information. (Margaret Cole)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ Will of James lundy, Virginia Will Book 2- p153 (heirs: son James; daughter Burchel; son Edward; son Robert; daughter Elizabeth; son Thomas a tract of land after the decease of John Tiller and Susanna his wife; wife Elizabeth. W
2 CONC ife, Extx. Presented in Court by Elizabeth Perry.
2 CONT ↑ The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints, "Pedigree Resource File," database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/2:2:S1Y5-6RZ : accessed 2016-11-06), entry for Robert /Lundy/. PEDIGREE RESOURCE FILE
2 CONT ↑ Virginia Land Patents Book 15
2 CONT Southampton County Will Book 4, 1783-1797, Pages 46 & 47
