2 CONT '''Sarah Green''' [1]
2 CONT * F, 
2 CONT * b. 7 October 1642, 
2 CONT * d. after 1699
2 CONT * Sarah Green was born on 7 October 1642 at Cambridge, Middlesex County, Massachusetts. [4],[3] 
2 CONT * She was the daughter of Samuel Green and Jane Banbridge. [2],[3] 
2 CONT * Sarah Green '''married Nathaniel Butle'''r, son of Deacon Richard Butler and Elizabeth Bigelow, before 1667; 
2 CONT * The son of Nathaniel Butler was treated by John Winthrop, Jr. in July 1667. [1],[5] 
2 CONT * Sarah Green '''married Philip Olcott''' on 4 April 1699 at Wethersfield, Hartford County, Connecticut. [6],[1] 
2 CONT * Sarah Green died after 1699 at Connecticut. [4]
2 CONT * Children of Sarah Green and Nathaniel Butler
2 CONT ** 1. Samuel Butler b. c Jan 1667, d. c 1708 [7]
2 CONT ** 2. Hannah Butler b. c 1668, d. a 1698 [1]
2 CONT ** 3. Ann Butler+ d. a 1737/38 [1]
2 CONT ** 4. William Butler d. a 1698 [7]
2 CONT ** 5. Abigail Butler b. 1671, d. a 1698 [7]
2 CONT ** 6. Ruth Butler b. 1672, d. a 1698 [7]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Citations'''
2 CONT * 1. [S500] Donald Lines Jacobus, "Connections".
2 CONT * 2. [S159] Gary Boyd (Selected and introduced articles which were written by others) Roberts, Genealogies of Connecticut Families, Vol. II.
2 CONT * 3. [S159] Gary Boyd (Selected and introduced articles which were written by others) Roberts, Genealogies of Connecticut Families.
2 CONT * 4. [S131] Benjamin H. Gaylord, "Gaylord Ancestry", Vol. 46, pp. 6-10
2 CONT * 5. [S400] Massachusetts Historical Society, Winthrop Medical Journal.
2 CONT * 6. [S125] Wethersfield Vital Records.
2 CONT * 7. [S186] Nathaniel Butler Probate Volume 5.
