1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Isaac LEARNED b. 16-Sep-1655, Chelmsford, MA, m. 23-Jul-1679, Sarah BIGELOW, b. 29-Sep-1659. Isaac died 15-Sep-1737.
2 CONT
2 CONT  On February 27th, 1679, Isaac bought the 40 acre farm of Thomas Eames adjacent to a small pond, which today still bears his name, Learned Pond, in Framingham, MA.  Six months later he married Sarah, the daughter of his neighbor, 
2 CONC John Bigelow and the younger sister of his compatriot, Joshua, from the King Philip's War.
