2 CONT * Learned, William L. The Learned Family (Learned, Larned, Learnard, Larnard and Lerned). Being Descendants of William Learned, Who Was of Charlestown, Massachusetts in 1632. (Second Edition). (1898). CS/71/L437/1898
2 CONT
2 CONT  ISAAC LEARNED Jr son of Isaac Learned Sr was born in Chelmsford Mass 16 Sept 1655. He married Sarah Bigelow 23 July 1679 in Chelmsford. She was born in Watertown 29 Sept 1659. The daughter of John & Sarah(Warren)Bigelow. They set
2 CONC tled in Framingham near the beautiful pond of 36 acres that is still called Learned’s pond.  He was a soldier in Capt Davenport’s company at the Narragansett fight and was wounded. He was received as an inhabitant of Sherborn in A
2 CONC pril 1679.(Framingham was not a town at that time.) He was on the committee to procure the act of incorporation for the town in 1699. It was voted in town meeting 21 Aug 1700 that Mr Joseph Buckminster, Isaac Learned, and John Hea
2 CONC ver should be the men to go and discourse with a lawyer about our aggrieved neighbors. Isaac was selectman in 1692, 1698, 1706, and 1711. He was fence viewer in 1681/2.  Isaac’s brother Benoni settled in Framingham before 1680.   
2 CONC  Isaac paid the highest tax of any one living Framingham, so he must have owned one or more of the mills.
2 CONT                   Children of Isaac and Sarah
2 CONT                               Isaac b 10 May 1680
2 CONT                              Sarah b 16 Mar 1682
2 CONT                   Abigail b 11 Mar 1684
2 CONT                             Mary    b 12 Apr 1686
2 CONT                            William b 12 Feb 1688
2 CONT                       *Ebenezer b 31 Aug 1690
2 CONT                          Samuel    b 4   Oct 1692
2 CONT                           Hannah   b 16 Sept 1694
2 CONT                           Elizabeth b 27 July 1696
2 CONT                            Moses     b 29 Apr 1699
2 CONT                           Martha     b 21 May 1702 
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac died 15 September 1737, one day before his 82 birthday.
2 CONT
