2 CONT # William [Learned]  birth: 12 Feb 1688 Framingham, Middlesex, Ma   death: 11 Jun 1747 Killingly, Windham, Ct   burial:	Killingly, Windham, Ct
2 CONT # Hannah /Learned/  birth:	16 Sep 1694 Framingham, Middlesex, Massachusetts
2 CONT # Moses /Learned/  birth:	29 Apr 1699  Framingham, Middlesex, Ma  death:	25 May 1769 Framingham, Middlesex, Ma
2 CONT # Elizabeth /Learned/  birth: 27 Jul 1696  Framingham, Middlesex, Ma  death:	23 Apr 1738 Medway, Norfolk, Mass
2 CONT # Ebenezer /Learned/  birth:	ABT. 1690 Framingham, Middlesex, Ma death: 15 Mar 1772 Oxford, Worcester, Ma
2 CONT # Mary /Learned/  birth: 10 Oct 1688  Watertown, Or Sherborne, Middlesex, Ma  death: 24 Apr 1716  Sherborn, Middlesex, Mass.
