2 CONC iages Prior to 1700. By Clarence Almon Torrey,] Elizabeth Petty Bentley.  Learned,  Benoni (1657-1738).  1st wife, Mary Fanning (1662-1688);  2nd wife, Sarah [Wright] (1664-1737)
