1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''John Stearns''' was born on June 24, 1677, in Watertown, Middlesex County, Massachusetts. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-23754401 Corp. Samuel Stearns, I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-71036410 Hannah Stearn
2 CONC s]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34247493 Abigail Stearns] on February 21, 1701 in Watertown, Middlesex County, MA, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-71034901 John Stearns, Jr.]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-71035192 Josiah Stearns]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-70996566 Rev David Stearns]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34666591141 Lydia Goodrich]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-70996584 Lois White]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-70996565 Joseph Stearns]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-70996580 Abigail Stearns]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-70996568 Thomas Stearns]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-70996569 James Stearns]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34247952 Hannah Stearns]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-70996572 Benjamin Stearns]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-70996573 Peter Stearns]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-70996575 William Stearns]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-70996576 James Stearns]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-70996579 Abijah Stearns]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on October 26, 1729, in Lunenburg, Middlesex County, Massachusetts. 
2 CONT ----
