1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 32 MARY STEARNS, b. Apr 5, 1679; md. Nov. 2, 1699, Samuel Jennison, b. Oct 12, 1673, who d. Dec. 2, 1732, son of Samuel and Judith (Macomber) Jennison, of Watertown, Mass.
2 CONT
2 CONT (a) Mary Jennison, b., Aug. 17, 1700; md., Nov. 6, 1773, John Gerrish, of Salem, Mass.
2 CONT (b) Hannah Jennison, b., July 17, 1702; md. (i), Feb. 15, 1724-5, Jonathan Stone Jr.; md. (2), John Goddard, of Brookline, Mass.
2 CONT (c) Samuel Jennison, b., Sept. 26, 1704.
2 CONT (d) William Jennison, b., Feb. 9, 1706-7; grad. Harv. Coll., 1724; d., Apr., 1750, in Watertown, Mass.
2 CONT (e) Nathaniel Jennison, b., Apr. 5, 1709; md., Oct. 23, 1729, Abigail Mead, of Weston, Mass.
2 CONT (f) John Jennison, b., Feb. 19, 1710-11; md., July 21, 1740, in Lunenburg, Mass., Mary Hubbard, sister of Ruth Hubbard, who was wife of Rev. David Stearns (334)- He d., 1751.
2 CONT (g) Lydia Jennison, b., Apr. 2, 1712; md., Jan. 11, 1736-7, Rev. Ebenezer White of Brookline, Mass.
2 CONT (h) Abigail Jennison, b., Apr. 22, 1715; md., Sept. 24,. 1739, in Lunenburg, Jonathan Hubbard Jr.
2 CONT (i) Mercy Jennison, b., Mar. 11, 1717-18; md., June 26, 1740, Dr. Stanton Prentice, a physician, of Lancaster, Mass.
2 CONT (j) Sarah Jennison, b., Aug., 1720, d., Nov., 1720.
2 CONT (k) Eunice Jennison, b., Feb., 1721-2; md., July 11,. 1739, Joshua Richardson, of Woburn, Mass.[1]
2 CONT Birth
2 CONT
2 CONT 5 Apr 1679, Watertown, Mass, Mary Sternes, dau. to Samuel Sternes and Hannah[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Stearns-1137
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary (Stearns) Jennison (1679)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Mary Jennison formerly Stearns===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 5 Apr 1679 in Watertown, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Samuel Stearns and Hannah (Manning) Stearns
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Samuel Stearns, Hannah (Stearns) Gookin, Nathaniel Stearns, Sarah (Stearns) Winship, Samuel Stearns Jr., Isaac Stearns, John Stearns, Abigail (Stearns) Garfield and Joseph Stearns
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Samuel (Jennison) Jennings — married 2 Nov 1699 in Watertown, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Hannah (Jennison) Goddard, Samuel Jennison, William Jennison, Nathaniel Jennison, John Jenison, Lydia (Jennison) White and Abigail (Jennison) Hubbard
2 CONT
