2 CONT Abigail Stearns Gearfield
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Apr. 16, 1680 Watertown Middlesex County Massachusetts, USA Death: 	Jul. 13, 1710 Weston Middlesex County Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Stearns, daughter of Samuel and Hannah (Manning) Stearns was born in Watertown, Middlesex, Massachusetts 16 April 1680. She married in Watertown, Middlesex, Massachusetts 10 June 1706/07 Benoni Garfield, also of Watertown.
2 CONC  She died in Weston, Middlesex, Massachusetts 11 July 1710 at the age of 29 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Bond's Genealogies and History of Watertown 2nd Edition Garfield: Pages 231-235 Stearns: Pages 454-455 This source spells the Gearfield name as Garfield as cited above.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Weston Births, Deaths, & Marriages Deaths: Page 335 Gearfield, Abigail, wife Benoni July 13, 1710 age 29y G.R.3 - Farmers Burial Ground
