1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Abigail Morse Parkhurst=
2 CONT * BIRTH 6 Aug 1677 Watertown, Middlesex County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 3 May 1758 (aged 80), Weston, Middlesex County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Farmers Burial Ground, Weston, Middlesex County, Massachusetts, USA Show Map
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 18048878 Photos by family historian & Bill McEvoy
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Morse, was a descendant of Joseph Morse, who came to this country in 1634 from England and the daughter of Deacon John & Abigail (Stearns) Morse. The children of Deacon John and Abigail (Morse) Parkhurst were all born in W
2 CONC atertown Farms, now Weston, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT Here Lyes ye Body of
2 CONT MRS. ABIGAIL PARKHURST
2 CONT Wife of Deacon
2 CONT John Parkhurst
2 CONT who departed this life
2 CONT May ye 3rd 1758 in ye
2 CONT 81st Year of Her Age
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT John Morse 1638–1702
2 CONT Abigail Stearns Morse 1624–1690
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT John Parkhurst 1672–1764 (m. 1694)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT John Morse 1670 – unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 10x all b. in Watertown Farms, now Weston, MA
2 CONT 1. John Parkhurst b. & d. 1695
2 CONT 2. John Parkhurst b. 29 April 1697
2 CONT 3. Abigail Parkhurst b. 20 June 1699; m. 23 September 1728, John Pike of Newbury, Essex, MA
2 CONT 4. Lydia Parkhurst b. 21 July 1701; married 11 April 1723, Joseph Stone of Framingham, Middlesex, MA
2 CONT 5. Elizabeth Parkhurst b. 5 April 1704; d. December 1732, unmarried
2 CONT 6. Josiah Parkhurst b. 9 February 1706; m. 23 October 1735, Sarah Carter
2 CONT 7. Isaac Parkhurst b. 9 July 1708; m. 7 February 1733/34; Lydia Bigelow
2 CONT 8. Mary Parkhurst Bailey b. 15 July 1710; m. 20 August 1731, Edmund Bailey of Newbury, Essex, MA d. 1736
2 CONT 9. Jonas Parkhurst b. 20 August 1712, m. Abigail Bigelow d.1798
2 CONT 10. Jemima Parkhurst b. 5 June 1715; m. 20 April 1738, Benjamin Bartlett of Newbury, Essex, MA
2 CONT
