2 CONT Sarah (Huse) Smith (1754 - 1811)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Smith formerly Huse
2 CONT Born 14 May 1754 in Brentwood, Rockingham, New Hampshiremap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Daughter of Thomas Huce and Anna (Graves) Huce
2 CONT [sibling(s) unknown]
2 CONT Wife of Elisha Smith — married [date unknown] in New Hampshire, United Statesmap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Mother of Hezekiah Smith, Ebenezer Smith, Anna (Smith) Rand and Moses Smith
2 CONT Died 14 Aug 1811 at age 57 in Belknap, New Hampshire, United Statesmap [uncertain]
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONS
2 CONT Profile last modified 8 Oct 2023 | Created 7 Dec 2015
2 CONT This page has been accessed 167 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Huse is the daughter of Thomas Huse and Anna Huse. Wife of Elisha Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah married Captain Elisha Smith and was the mother of ten children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. Elisha Smith married Sarah Huse. Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisha, b. Aug. 16, 1777;
2 CONT
2 CONT Sally, b. Oct. 17, 1778;
2 CONT
2 CONT Hezekiah, b. Jan. 3, 1780; d. Feb. 16, 1817;
2 CONT
2 CONT Ebenezer, b. Jan. 7, 1782 - 1846;
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna, b. Oct. 6, 1783, married name Rand;
2 CONT
2 CONT Huse, b. Oct. 10, 1785;
2 CONT
2 CONT Molly, b. Dec. 14, 1787;
2 CONT
2 CONT Betsy, b. July 17, 1790;
2 CONT
2 CONT Moses, b. May 4, 1792, d. Dec. 29, 1877;
2 CONT
2 CONT Lavina, b. March 3, 1794
2 CONT
2 CONT [1]
