1 TITL Capt.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Capt. Samuel Graves (383) was born 24 Dec. 1774 at Marblehead, Mass., was baptized 25 Dec. 1774, and was lost at sea March 1806, off the coast of Va.  He married Polly Paine on 26 Nov. 1797.  They lived in Marblehe
2 CONC ad. He was a sea captain and commanded a brig from Baltimore, Md.  (R‑201)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children - Graves
2 CONT
2 CONT #    790.    Martha Graves, b. 1799, d. 31 Jan. 1882.
2 CONT #    791.    Eliza Graves, b. 1799, d. 17 Dec. 1865.  Twin of Martha.
2 CONT # +792.    Samuel Graves, b. 29 March 1804, m. Sarah Sparhawk, 11 April 1833, d. 27 Jan. 1881.
