1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=131125111-28-93320&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-10da7b4cf65ab62c51c023a5ddea9855&mrid=f5cb01282d9287e4172
2 CONC 0914b0d7476f3 MyHeritage Match] via sister [http://www.geni.com/profile-60224674 Sarah Wight (born Corbin)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 11 2014, 16:17:09 UTC''
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Corbin-1168
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan Corbin was born on 20 Aug 1760 in Woodstock, Connecticut to Jabez Corbin and Sarah (Abbot) Corbin. He is the brother of Sarah (Corbin) Wigh. He married Abigail (Wight) Corbin on 24 Dec 1781 in Oxford, Worcester, Massachus
2 CONC etts, United States. Ye is the father of Esther (Corbin) Handy. Jonathan died after 26 Dec 1817 in Webster, Worcester, Massachusetts, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 10 May 2018 | Created 5 Oct 2015
2 CONT
2 CONT Additionally, he was a U.S. Army Private in the American Revolutionary War.
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan was born in 1760. Jonathan Corbin ... He passed away after 1796.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth
2 CONT
2 CONT 1760, August 20 in Woodstock Twp, Windham, Conneticut; Jonathan Corbin, son of Jabez Corbin and Sarah.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT 1781, November 11 in Oxford, Worcester, Massachusetts, United States: Jonathan Corbin married Abigail Wight.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial
2 CONT
