2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QSQ-G97W-9432?view=index&action=view&cc=1803978&lang=en is a picture of an abstract from the marriage records of Hallowell, Maine, showing that John Hovey and Anna Cummings were married
