1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/M786-TVG
2 CONT (21 sources linked0
2 CONT Brief Life History of Nathan'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Nathan Abbott was born on 18 November 1756, in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts, United States, his father, Asa Abbott, was 35 and his mother, Elizabeth Abbott, was 30. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Margaret Willson on 22 May 1785, in Danvers, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT Elizabeth Abbott 1784–1883
2 CONT Martha Abbot 1788–1875
2 CONT Nathan Abbot 1790–1864
2 CONT Lydia Abbot 1792–1873
2 CONT Sophronia Abbott 1795–1879
2 CONT Judith Abbott 1797–1870
2 CONT Asenath Abbot 1801–1859
