2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 10 January 1840, at the age of 83, and was buried in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Andover/aBirthsA.shtml "(ABBOT (Abbet, Abbett, Abbott, Abbut, Abbutt, Abett)) Nathan, s. Asa and Elezebith, Nov. 18, 1756."
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Danvers/aMarriagesA.shtml "(ABBOTT (Abbot)) Nathan, and Margaret Willson, May 22, 1785.*"
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Middlesex/Billerica/aDeathsA.shtml "(ABBOTT (Abbot)) Nathan [dup. [b. Margaret]], Jan. 10, 1840, a. 83. GR2"
2 CONT
2 CONT Danvers VR has Nathan & Margaret with these children:
2 CONT * Elizabeth, d. Nathan and Margaret, Feb. 24, 1786. married, in Billerica, (1) Edward H. Russel, Sept. 6, 1807.
2 CONT * Martha, d. Nathan and Margaret, Jan. 17, 1788. married, in Billerica, Leonard Cushing of Waltham, Apr. 7, 1825.
2 CONT * Nathan, s. Nathan and Margaret, Feb. 7, 1790. married, in Billerica, Hannah Farmer, Nov. 10, 1825.
2 CONT * Lydia, d. Nathan and Margaret, Aug. 9, 1792. married, in Billerica, Nathaniel Stevenson of Roxbury, Apr. 5, 1819.
2 CONT * Sophronia, at Billerica, Jan. 20, 1795. married, in Billerica, Asa Bushby Jr. of Danvers, Dec. 26, 1819.
2 CONT * Mary, at Billerica, Aug. 15, 1804. married, in Danvers, Henry Bushby, Feb. 24, 1830.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Wilson-53566 also has Nathan and Margaret with:
2 CONT * Judith (1797) married, in Billerica, Levi Felton of Chelmsford, Oct. 3, 1824.
2 CONT * Asenath (1801) 
