0 @N6000000000146852347@ NOTE Lucy Neville (John Earl of Northumberland, #44770); born circa 1466 of Salisbury, Wiltshire, England,[N]; married Sir Thomas FitzWilliam, son of Sir Richard FitzWilliam Sheriff of York and Elizabeth Clarell, circa 1485 of Wiltshir
1 CONC e; married Sir Anthony Browne (see #22384), son of Sir Thomas Browne and Alianor Arundel, 1491; died 25 Mar 1533/34[N]; buried 30 Jun 1534 Bisham Abbey, Berkshire, England.
