1 CONT Notes
1 CONT Entered Gray's Inn (law), London, Eng. - 19 May 1637, 
1 CONT Came to VA 1650. Founded "Belfield' near York River. Grew sweet tobacco and 
1 CONT cultivated silkworms. 
1 CONT He and wife, Elizabeth, had 6 sons and 6 daughters. Many of the name in VA 
1 CONT and country. 
1 CONT Belfield is now National landmark. Only the cem. remains. Have photos of 
