1 CONT Posted by: Patricia Watkins Schmidt 
1 CONT Message: For those who are related to our Catherine Digges of Virginia who married William Herndon from Virginia. We have a digges descendant tour going to retrace our roots June 7th, 2001. Contact me at camelot817@aol.com 
1 CONT
