0 @N6000000002046118227@ NOTE Rev. William Brown, his wife, his daughter Phebe and her husband Thomas Lee, Jr. and their 3 children left for America 1641-1645.  Thomas Lee and Rev. Brown died at sea.  Phoebe Brown Lee married Greenfield Larrabee and had severa
