0 @N6000000003795948886@ NOTE Hyde Family Genealogy
1 CONT http://www.renderplus.com/hartgen/htm/hyde.htm
1 CONT 17.Samuel Hyde - was born about 1637 in Hartford, CT and died Jul 1677 in Norwich, CT . He was the son of William Hyde.
1 CONT Samuel married Jane Lee Jun 1659 in Saybrook, CT. Jane was born on 12 Sep 1640 in England. She was the daughter of Thomas Lee and Phoebe Brown. She died on 12 Jan 1722/1723 in Lebanon, New London, CT .
1 CONT
1 CONT Samuel - is reckoned among the first proprietors of Norwich, as is likewise his father.
1 CONT
1 CONT The descendants of the five sons of Samuel Hyde in 1779 showed updards of twenty families of Hydes, comprising 150 persons in the town plot and western part of Norwich.
1 CONT
1 CONT "Samuel and Jann (Lee) Hyde are also the ancestors of Grover Cleveland, President of the United States. Their eldest son, John Hyde, who married experience abel, had a son James, known as Capt. James Hyde, who married Sarah Marsha
1 CONC ll. They in turn had a daughter, Abiah Hyde, who married Rev. Aaron Cleveland. Their son, William Cleavelamd and his wife Margaret Falley, were the grand-parents of Grover Cleveland."
1 CONT
1 CONT ( from A genealogical History of the Kelley family) (Sources: - 5 (pg 301) - 6)
1 CONT Children: (Quick Family Chart)
1 CONT i. John Hyde was born Dec 1667 in Norwich, CT and died on 26 Jul 1727 in Norwich, CT . See #18. below.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Kinship II - A collection of family, friends and U.S. Presidents 
1 CONT URL:  http://worldconnect.genealogy.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=:2902060&id=I575153845
