1 CONT Christening: 25 Aug 1641 Manchester, Lancashire, England, England 
1 CONT Burial: Died At Age 79 
1 CONT Change Date: 9 Nov 2003 1 1 1 
1 CONT Note: Ancestral File Number: 1KLG-L3 
1 CONT
