1 CONT 160 William, b. Jan., 1670, m. Ann dau. of Richard Bushnell.
1 CONT           He inherited the homestead of his
1 CONT           grandfather in the town plot. He lived to
1 CONT           be nearly 90, and d. Aug. 8, 1759. He had
1 CONT           ten children, nine of whom left descendants.
1 CONT           His oldest son, William, was the first Hyde to
1 CONT           receive a college education. He graduated at
1 CONT           Yale, 1721.
1 CONT [Dana-Hyde, p. 50]
